ck" title="Gelée bien eue" questid="632" questname="Gelée bien eue" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="24" class="tag-dungeon" id="18" type="dungeon" name="Gelaxième Dimension" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="24"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Gelaxième Dimension</span></span>1️⃣ (<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes</span><span style="color: rgb(100, 181, 246);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(235, 65, 101);">brâkmarien</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">cliquez&nbsp;</span>sur l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">arbre en gelée</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">jaune </span>à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Gelée bien eue" questid="632" questname="Gelée bien eue" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [2,-1], <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">entrez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">au </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">milieu </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et</span> prenez la<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);"> porte de gauche</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">puis</span> parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Alain Deix</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">pour finir </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="906" class="tag-quest" id="632" type="quest" name="Gelée bien eue" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="906"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Gelée bien eue</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="C''est radical ici" questid="1949" questname="C''est radical ici" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2506" class="tag-quest" id="1949" type="quest" name="C''est radical ici" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="2506"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>C''est radical ici</span></span>.</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">1️⃣ Pour </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">combattre </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">les </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">4 Gelées Royales</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, choisissez dans chaque salle un </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">groupe </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">composé d''une </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">majorité </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">de </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">gelées </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">que vous n''avez</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> pas encore combattu</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Exemple </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">de </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">groupe </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">avec une </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">majorité </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">à vaincre :</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Salle 1 </span>:<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="55" class="tag-monster" id="17" type="monster" name="Gelée Bleuet" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/17.png" dofusdbid="55"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/17.png" alt="monster"><span>Gelée Bleuet</span></span>, <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">salle 2 </span>:<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);"> </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="56" class="tag-monster" id="18" type="monster" name="Gelée Menthe" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/18.png" dofusdbid="56"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/18.png" alt="monster"><span>Gelée Menthe</span></span>,<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);"> salle 3 </span>:<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);"> </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="57" class="tag-monster" id="19" type="monster" name="Gelée Fraise" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/19.png" dofusdbid="57"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/19.png" alt="monster"><span>Gelée Fraise</span></span> et enfin <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">salle 4 </span>: <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="429" class="tag-monster" id="245" type="monster" name="Gelée Citron" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/231.png" dofusdbid="429"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/231.png" alt="monster"><span>Gelée Citron</span></span>.</p>', 5, '[GP5] Sufokia', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 660, 1280, false, '{}', 35, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.139', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.139');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqng002nygogsfqyga1v', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 60 à 70 🥩</p><p style="text-align: center;">🌽 Paysan/Alchimiste 40 à 50 🌽</p><p>Continuez de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">métier </span>jusqu''au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 50</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>de l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="533" class="tag-item" id="257" type="item" name="Avoine" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34154.png" dofusdbid="533"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34154.png" alt="item"><span>Avoine</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="536" class="tag-item" id="258" type="item" name="Pain aux Flocons d''Avoine" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33005.png" dofusdbid="536"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33005.png" alt="item"><span>Pain aux Flocons d''Avoine</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">paysan</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="395" class="tag-item" id="163" type="item" name="Trèfle à 5 feuilles" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36067.png" dofusdbid="395"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36067.png" alt="item"><span>Trèfle à 5 feuilles</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="283" class="tag-item" id="71" type="item" name="Potion de Soin" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12003.png" dofusdbid="283"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12003.png" alt="item"><span>Potion de Soin</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alchimiste</span>.</p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 60 à 70 🥩</p><p style="text-align: left;">Pour monter le métier <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur niveau 70</span>, prévoyez :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p style="text-align: left;">168 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17132" class="tag-item" id="9968" type="item" name="Viande Ladre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63420.png" dofusdbid="17132"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63420.png" alt="item"><span>Viande Ladre</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p style="text-align: left;">168 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="533" class="tag-item" id="257" type="item" name="Avoine" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34154.png" dofusdbid="533"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34154.png" alt="item"><span>Avoine</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p style="text-align: left;">168 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1973" class="tag-item" id="980" type="item" name="Huile à frire" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/60073.png" dofusdbid="1973"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/60073.png" alt="item"><span>Huile à frire</span></span> (ou 17 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16829" class="tag-item" id="9694" type="item" name="Tonneau d''Huile à Frire" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180017.png" dofusdbid="16829"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180017.png" alt="item"><span>Tonneau d''Huile à Frire</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17177" class="tag-item" id="10013" type="item" name="Friture Amaknéenne" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69752.png" dofusdbid="17177"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69752.png" alt="item"><span>Friture Amaknéenne</span></span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 0, 1280, true, '{}', 36, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.156', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.156');
