INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqoe002tygogv4zg7rw6', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Tour du Monde.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif :</span> Tour du Monde.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="186" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP24] OTOMAÏ 2" label="[GP24] OTOMAÏ 2" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP24] OTOMAÏ 2</span>1️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Chéri fais-moi peur" questid="633" questname="Chéri fais-moi peur" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="39" class="tag-dungeon" id="31" type="dungeon" name="Cale de l''Arche d''Otomaï" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="39"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Cale de l''Arche d''Otomaï</span></span> (<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>).</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Chéri fais-moi peur" questid="633" questname="Chéri fais-moi peur" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [2,-1], <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">entrez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">au </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">milieu </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 2