15"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/75003.png" alt="item"><span>Parchemin du Mantiscroc</span></span> dans vos consommables pour <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">apprendre </span>le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">sort </span>et sa <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">variante</span>.</p>', 17, '[GP17] Saharach 1', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 660, 1600, false, '{}', 43, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.251', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.251');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqqe0034ygogs6el8h9j', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', '100% WABBIT + DOFUS CAWOTTE', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="972" class="tag-item" id="502" type="item" name="Dofus Cawotte" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23006.png" dofusdbid="972"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23006.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Cawotte</span></span> et Tour du Monde.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="24" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP13] 100% WABBIT + DOFUS CAWOTTE" label="[GP13] 100% Wabbit + Dofus Cawotte" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP13] 100% Wabbit + Dofus Cawotte</span> depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 50</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un défilé de Wobots" questid="1142" questname="Un défilé de Wobots" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17" class="tag-dungeon" id="13" type="dungeon" name="Terrier du Wa Wabbit" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="17"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Terrier du Wa Wabbit</span></span>1️⃣ et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Capturez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3460" class="tag-monster" id="1504" type="monster" name="Wa Wobot" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1006.png" dofusdbid="3460"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1006.png" alt="monster"><span>Wa Wobot</span></span> pour le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="66" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" label="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE</span>2️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(235, 29, 78);">Félicitations !</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> En terminant le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="24" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP13] 100% WABBIT + DOFUS CAWOTTE" label="[GP13] 100% WABBIT + DOFUS CAWOTTE" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP13] 100% WABBIT + DOFUS CAWOTTE</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, vous obtenez le </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="972" class="tag-item" id="502" type="item" name="Dofus Cawotte" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23006.png" dofusdbid="972"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23006.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Cawotte</span></span> !</p><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un défilé de Wobots" questid="1142" questname="Un défilé de Wobots" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-16,2]<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span>(<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>des <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Eleveurs</span>) et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Thelma Geur</span> pour finir <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1431" class="tag-quest" id="1142" type="quest" name="Un défilé de Wobots" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="1431"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Un défilé de Wobots</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="C''est du bateau" questid="1950" questname="C''est du bateau" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2507" class="tag-quest" id="1950" type="quest" name="C''est du bateau" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="2507"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>C''est du bateau</span></span>.</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur tous les monstres du donjon.</p><p>2️⃣ <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Capturez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3460" class="tag-monster" id="1504" type="monster" name="Wa Wobot" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1006.png" dofusdbid="3460"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1006.png" alt="monster"><span>Wa Wobot</span></span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">autant de fois</span> que vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avez </span>de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">personnages</span>.</p>', 13, '[GP13] 100% WABBIT + DOFUS CAWOTTE', NULL, '#f59e0b', 0, 1600, false, '{}', 44, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.262', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.262');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqqv0037ygoggrq1pcxc', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 80 à 90 🥩</p><p style="text-align: center;">🌽 Paysan/Alchimiste 60 à 70 🌽</p><p style="text-align: left;">Continuez de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">métier </span>jusqu''au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 70</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>de l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="401" class="tag-item" id="169" type="item" name="Houblon" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34080.png" dofusdbid="401"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34080.png" alt="item"><span>Houblon</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2024" class="tag-item" id="997" type="item" name="Briochette" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33015.png" dofusdbid="2024"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33015.png" alt="item"><span>Briochette</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">paysan</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="380" class="tag-item" id="148" type="item" name="Menthe Sauvage" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36052.png" dofusdbid="380"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36052.png" alt="item"><span>Menthe Sauvage</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="282" class="tag-item" id="70" type="item" name="Potion de Soin supérieure" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12039.png" dofusdbid="282"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12039.png" alt="item"><span>Potion de Soin supérieure</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alchimiste</span>.</p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 80 à 90 🥩</p><p>Pour monter le métier <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur niveau 90</span>, prévoyez :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p style="text-align: left;">164 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17136" class="tag-item" id="9972" type="item" name="Viande Sanguinolente" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63464.png" dofusdbid="17136"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63464.png" alt="item"><span>Viande Sanguinolente</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p style="text-align: left;">164 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="401" class="tag-item" id="169" type="item" name="Houblon" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34080.png" dofusdbid="401"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34080.png" alt="item"><span>Houblon</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p style="text-align: left;">164 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1983" class="tag-item" id="988" type="item" name="Graisse Gélatineuse" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15379.png" dofusdbid="1983"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15379.png" alt="item"><span>Graisse Gélatineuse</span></span> (ou 17 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16827" class="tag-item" id="9692" type="item" name="Sachet de Graisse Gélatineuse" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180007.png" dofusdbid="16827"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180007.png" alt="item"><span>Sachet de Graisse Gélatineuse</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17181" class="tag-item" id="10017" type="item" name="Terrine Bontarienne" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69840.png" dofusdbid="17181"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69840.png" alt="item"><span>Terrine Bontarienne</span></span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 220, 1760, true, '{}', 45, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.279', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.279');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqr20038ygoghrcg44qu', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'Île de Moon et Tour du Monde.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Île de Moon et Tour du Monde.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="30" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO" label="[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 19&nbsp;</span>jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 22</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="C''est du bateau" questid="1950" questname="C''est du bateau" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="91" class="tag-dungeon" id="78" type="dungeon" name="Bateau du Chouque" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="91"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Bateau du Chouque</span></span>1️⃣.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="C''est du bateau" questid="1950" questname="C''est du bateau" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-16,2]<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span>(<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>des <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Eleveurs</span>) et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Thelma Geur</span> pour finir <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2507" class="tag-quest" id="1950" type="quest" name="C''est du bateau" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="2507"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>C''est du bateau</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Le spectacle vivant" questid="1951" questname="Le spectacle vivant" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2508" class="tag-quest" id="1951" type="quest" name="Le spectacle vivant" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="2508"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Le spectacle vivant</span></span>.</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="4161" class="tag-monster" id="2127" type="monster" name="Ivremor" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1324.png" dofusdbid="4161"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1324.png" alt="monster"><span>Ivremor</span></span>.</p>', 14, '[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO', NULL, '#f59e0b', 440, 1760, false, '{}', 46, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.286', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.286');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqrf003aygognsbbqny8', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Sidimote 2 et Tour du Monde.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Sidimote 2 et Tour du Monde.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="307" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire" label="[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 39</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Le spectacle vivant" questid="1951" questname="Le spectacle vivant" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="105" class="tag-dungeon" id="92" type="dungeon" name="Chapiteau des Magik Riktus" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="105"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Chapiteau des Magik Riktus</span></span>1️⃣(<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>).</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Le spectacle vivant" questid="1951" questname="Le spectacle vivant" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-16,2] (<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>des <span styl