INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqrt003cygogwaioynal', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'Prérequis du', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Prérequis du <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="29134" class="tag-item" id="18869" type="item" name="Dofus Sylvestre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23036.png" dofusdbid="29134"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23036.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Sylvestre</span></span>, Ocre d''Ambre, Alignement et Tour du Monde.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><p>Pour cette étape, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avancez </span>les<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> guides </span>jusqu''à atteindre l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="89" class="tag-dungeon" id="76" type="dungeon" name="Antre de la Reine Nyée" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="89"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Antre de la Reine Nyée</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="2042" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP86] L''ARBRE QUI CACHE LA FORÊT" label="[GP86] L''ARBRE QUI CACHE LA FORÊT" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP86] L''ARBRE QUI CACHE LA FORÊT</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 15</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="104" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP7] Ocre d''Ambre" l