alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et :</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes</span><span style="color: rgb(100, 181, 246);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(235, 65, 101);">Brâkmarien</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">cliquez </span>d''abord sur la <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">boule de soie </span>à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Parlez à la <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reine Nyée</span> à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour du propriétaire" questid="1952" questname="Tour du propriétaire" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-45,19]<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span>(<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>du <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Village Côtier</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et</span> parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Anne Ullaire</span> pour finir <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2509" class="tag-quest" id="1952" type="quest" name="Tour du propriétaire" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="2509"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Tour du propriétaire</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour d''honneur" questid="1953" questname="Tour d''honneur" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2510" class="tag-quest" id="1953" type="quest" name="Tour d''honneur" image