INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqug003sygogszm8p3m0', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', '100% MOON + DOKOKO', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17078" class="tag-item" id="9915" type="item" name="Dokoko" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23022.png" dofusdbid="17078"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23022.png" alt="item"><span>Dokoko</span></span> et Tour du Monde.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="30" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO" label="[GP14] 100% Moon + Dokoko" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP14] 100% Moon + Dokoko</span>1️⃣ depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 22</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour d''horizon" questid="636" questname="Tour d''horizon" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="92" class="tag-dungeon" id="79" type="dungeon" name="Arbre de Moon" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="92"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Arbre de Moon</span></span>2️⃣3️⃣ (<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>A l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 32</span>, parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Moon</span> à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations !</span> En terminant le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="30" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO" label="[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO</span>, vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17078" class="tag-item" id="9915" type="item" name="Dokoko" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23022.png" dofusdbid="17078"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23022.png" alt="item"><span>Dokoko</span></span>.</p><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour d''horizon" questid="636" questname="Tour d''horizon" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-45,19]<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span>(<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>du <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Village Côtier</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et</span> parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Anne Ullaire</span> pour finir <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="910" class="tag-quest" id="636" type="quest" name="Tour d''horizon" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="910"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Tour d''horizon</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour à tour" questid="637" questname="Tour à tour" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="911" class="tag-quest" id="637" type="quest" name="Tour à tour" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="911"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Tour à tour</span></span>.</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ A la fin du guide vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtiendrez </span>le&nbsp;familier<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6716" class="tag-item" id="1824" type="item" name="Nomoon" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/18011.png" dofusdbid="6716"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/18011.png" alt="item"><span>Nomoon</span></span>, il est <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">conseillé </span>de le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter en niveau</span> pour l''utiliser lorsque vous aurez besoin de drop.</p><p>2️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="4163" class="tag-monster" id="2129" type="monster" name="Domoizelle" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1326.png" dofusdbid="4163"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1326.png" alt="monster"><span>Domoizelle</span></span>.</p><p>3️⃣ Vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span>aussi le sort <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Marteau de Moon</span> à la fin du donjon.</p>', 14, '[GP14] 100% MOON + DOKOKO', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 440, 2080, false, '{}', 54, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.408', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.408');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqur003uygogpt0q3d57', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'DOFUS TURQUOISE', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs : </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="739" class="tag-item" id="345" type="item" name="Dofus Turquoise" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" dofusdbid="739"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Turquoise</span></span> et Tour du Monde.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="131" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE" label="[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 7</span> incluse <span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">SANS </span>acheter les ressources des étapes 2 à 4.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un juge hystérique" questid="84" questname="Un juge hystérique" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6" class="tag-dungeon" id="4" type="dungeon" name="Antre du Dragon Cochon" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="6"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Antre du Dragon Cochon</span></span> (<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Cliquez </span>sur le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">socle </span>à gauche du trône à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un juge hystérique" questid="84" questname="Un juge hystérique" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-29,-47] (<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>de <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Bonta</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et parlez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Chris de Naire</span>.</p></div>', 33, '[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE', NULL, '#f59e0b', 660, 2080, false, '{}', 55, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.419', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.419');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqva003wygog2vhl1u6x', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Koalaks, Tour du Monde et Alignement.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Koalaks, Tour du Monde et Alignement.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="309" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP18] Koalaks" label="[GP18] Koalaks" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP18] Koalaks</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 3 </span>incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Bontarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Bontarien</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 144&nbsp;</span>jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 175</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un juge hystérique" questid="84" questname="Un juge hystérique" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="30" class="tag-dungeon" id="22" type="dungeon" name="Caverne du Koulosse" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="30"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Caverne du Koulosse</span></span>1️⃣2️⃣ (<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>, parlez au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Koulosse </span>à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un juge hystérique" questid="84" questname="Un juge hystérique" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-29,-47]<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span>(<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>de <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Bonta</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et parlez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Chris de Naire.</span></p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Pour aller</span> au donjon, passez en <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">autopilote </span>jusqu''en [-16,8] et allez <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">en haut à gauche</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Pour entrer </span>dans le donjon, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">placez vous </span>sur la<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> case devant </span>le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">PNJ</span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="671" class="tag-monster" id="330" type="monster" name="Bouftou des cavernes" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/359.png" dofusdbid="671"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/359.png" alt="monster"><span>Bouftou des cavernes</span></span> et un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="672" class="tag-monster" id="331" type="monster" name="Boufcoul" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/360.png" dofusdbid="672"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/360.png" alt="monster"><span>Boufcoul</span></span> dans l''<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Antre du Koulosse</span>.</p>', 18, '[GP18] Koalaks', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 0, 2080, false, '{}', 56, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.438', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.438');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqvw003zygogaf4v217n', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'QUETE_SERIE', 'Royaume d''Amakna, Koalaks et Otomaï 1.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Royaume d''Amakna, Koalaks et Otomaï 1.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="309" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP18] Koalaks" label="[GP18] Koalaks" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP18] Koalaks</span> depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 3</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p>Durant la quête de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">drop </span>sur les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">dragodindes</span>, profitez en pour <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">capturer</span>1️⃣ avec des<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> filets de capture </span>les DD suivantes :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>3 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7809" class="tag-item" id="2557" type="item" name="Dragodinde Rousse Sauvage" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/97006.png" dofusdbid="7809"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/97006.png" alt="item"><span>Dragodinde Rousse Sauvage</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>2 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7807" class="tag-item" id="2555" type="item" name="Dragodinde Amande Sauvage" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/97020.png" dofusdbid="7807"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/97020.png" alt="item"><span>Dragodinde Amande Sauvage</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>1 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7864" class="tag-item" id="2612" type="item" name="Dragodinde Dorée Sauvage" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/97074.png" dofusdbid="7864"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/97074.png" alt="item"><span>Dragodinde Dorée Sauvage</span></span></p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="375" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP12] Royaume d''Amakna" label="[GP12] Royaume d''Amakna" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP12] Royaume d''Amakna</span>1️⃣ depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 5</span> en achetant les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">ressources </span>de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 2</span> et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span>le.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="183" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP6] OTOMAÏ 1" label="[GP6] OTOMAÏ 1" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP6] OTOMAÏ 1</span>1️⃣ depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 5</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Dragodindes </span>(DD) servent pour les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2 guides</span> du bas et<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> plus tard</span> pour le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="66" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" label="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE</span>.</p><p>Si vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">ne faites pas</span> le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">contenu optionnel</span>, prévoyez en uniquement une de chaque pour le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="737" class="tag-item" id="344" type="item" name="Dofus Émeraude" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23002.png" dofusdbid="737"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23002.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Émeraude</span></span>.</p>', 18, '[GP18] Koalaks', NULL, '#10b981', 220, 2240, false, '{}', 57, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.46', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.46');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqwx0044ygog6xy1d6lo', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'DOFUS EMERAUDE', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif :</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="737" class="tag-item" id="344" type="item" name="Dofus Émeraude" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23002.png" dofusdbid="737"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23002.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Émeraude</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="66" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" label="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">1️⃣</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 20</span> à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 42</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><p>A l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 33</span>, vous serez <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">initié </span>à la nouvelle<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> mécanique </span>de<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> reproduction de montures</span>.</p><p>Vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">possédez </span>normalement les<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> 3 dragodindes </span>depuis l''étape précédente.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Pour l''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 38</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, capturez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">9 avis de recherches</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> de </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 120 ou moins</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, </span>vous trouverez une<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> liste</span> des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">milices </span>à cette même étape.</p>', 19, '[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE', NULL, '#f59e0b', 440, 2240, false, '{}', 58, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.497', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.497');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqxa0046ygogxphdnfee', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'Sidimote 2, Tour du Monde, Dofus Emeraude et Alignement.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Sidimote 2, Tour du Monde, Dofus Emeraude et Alignement.</p><p>Pour cette étape, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avancez </span>les<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> guides </span>jusqu''à atteindre la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="15" class="tag-dungeon" id="12" type="dungeon" name="Tanière du Meulou" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="15"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Tanière du Meulou</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes</span><span style="color: rgb(100, 181, 246);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(235, 65, 101);">Brâkmarien</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="773" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 114&nbsp;</span>jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 135</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reprenez&nbsp;</span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="307" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire" label="[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire</span>2️⃣&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 39</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 52</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="66" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" label="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE</span> depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 42</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un juge hystérique" questid="84" questname="Un juge hystérique" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="15" class="tag-dungeon" id="12" type="dungeon" name="Tanière du Meulou" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="15"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Tanière du Meulou</span></span>1️⃣ (<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>).</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations ! </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">En terminant le </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="66" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" label="[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP19] DOFUS EMERAUDE</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">vous </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="737" class="tag-item" id="344" type="item" name="Dofus Émeraude" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23002.png" dofusdbid="737"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23002.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Émeraude</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="307" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire" label="[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP22] Sidimote 2 : Hurlements de rire</span>2️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un juge hystérique" questid="84" questname="Un juge hystérique" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-29,-47] (<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>de <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Bonta</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et parlez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Chris de Naire.</span></p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="4866" class="tag-monster" id="2442" type="monster" name="Muloubard" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1591.png" dofusdbid="4866"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1591.png" alt="monster"><span>Muloubard</span></span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Cette fois-ci le guide <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Sidimote 2</span> n''est <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">pas optionnel</span> car les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2 quêtes</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 40 à la fin du guide</span> sont des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">prérequis </span>au <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7115" class="tag-item" id="2122" type="item" name="Dofus Ivoire" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23011.png" dofusdbid="7115"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23011.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ivoire</span></span>.</p>', 9, '[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN', NULL, '#f59e0b', 660, 2240, false, '{}', 59, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.51', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.51');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqy1004aygogvtgf4dhv', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🗡️ Mise à jour de l''équipement 🗡️</p><p>Pour la tranche de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 80-120</span>, il faut commencer à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">spécialiser</span> l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">équipement</span> selon la classe.</p><p>Pour se faire, le plus simple est de visiter le site suivant : <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://huzounet.fr/equipments">https://huzounet.fr/equipments</a>.</p><p style="text-align: left;">Dans les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">filtres</span>, choisissez le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">mode PVM</span>, votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">classe</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">élément</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">pour trouver des </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">équipements optimisés1️⃣2️⃣</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> correspondants à votre personnage.</span></p><p style="text-align: left;">L''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avantage</span> de ce site, c''est que réutiliserez<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span>certains <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">items selon </span>les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">tranches de niveau</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;">Cela vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">évitera </span>de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">recommencer </span>un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">équipement du début</span> à chaque fois.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">libre </span>de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">mettre </span>des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">trophées </span>ou de prendre une <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">dragodinde</span>.</p><p>2️⃣<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Prévoyez d''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">FM</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> vos </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">items </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">pour </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">augmenter votre vitalité maximale</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Pensez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">FM </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">votre </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">arme </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">avec </span>une <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="10057" class="tag-item" id="4249" type="item" name="Rune de chasse" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/78059.png" dofusdbid="10057"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/78059.png" alt="item"><span>Rune de chasse</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur</span>.</p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 0, 2240, true, '{}', 60, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.537', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.537');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqy7004bygogatdk3gmy', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 100 à 110 🥩</p><p style="text-align: center;">🌽 Paysan/Alchimiste 80 à 90 🌽</p><p style="text-align: left;">Continuez de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">métier </span>jusqu''au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 90</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>de l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="423" class="tag-item" id="188" type="item" name="Lin" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34122.png" dofusdbid="423"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34122.png" alt="item"><span>Lin</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="522" class="tag-item" id="251" type="item" name="Biscotte" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33012.png" dofusdbid="522"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33012.png" alt="item"><span>Biscotte</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">paysan</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="593" class="tag-item" id="270" type="item" name="Orchidée Freyesque" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/35192.png" dofusdbid="593"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/35192.png" alt="item"><span>Orchidée Freyesque</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1405" class="tag-item" id="640" type="item" name="Potion Eau de fée" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12041.png" dofusdbid="1405"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12041.png" alt="item"><span>Potion Eau de fée</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alchimiste</span>.</p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 100 à 110 🥩</p><p>Pour monter le métier <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur niveau 110</span>, prévoyez :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>162 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17140" class="tag-item" id="9976" type="item" name="Viande Exsudative" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63471.png" dofusdbid="17140"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63471.png" alt="item"><span>Viande Exsudative</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>162 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="423" class="tag-item" id="188" type="item" name="Lin" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34122.png" dofusdbid="423"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34122.png" alt="item"><span>Lin</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>162 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2331" class="tag-item" id="1243" type="item" name="Aubergine" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/46472.png" dofusdbid="2331"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/46472.png" alt="item"><span>Aubergine</span></span> (ou 17 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16819" class="tag-item" id="9684" type="item" name="Sachet d''Aubergines" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180001.png" dofusdbid="16819"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180001.png" alt="item"><span>Sachet d''Aubergines</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://dofusdb.fr/fr/database/object/17185"><span style="color: rgb(219, 149, 66);"><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17185" class="tag-item" id="10021" type="item" name="Poêlée Paysanne" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69804.png" dofusdbid="17185"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69804.png" alt="item"><span>Poêlée Paysanne</span></span></span></a><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 220, 2400, true, '{}', 61, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.543', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.543');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqqye004cygog9x6kqoa9', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Bonta et Brâkmar, Alignement et Tour du Monde.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Bonta et Brâkmar, Alignement et Tour du Monde.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>)<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> Commencez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="308" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP25] Bonta &amp; Brakmar : Frères ennemis" label="[GP25] Bonta &amp; Brakmar : Frères ennemis" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP25] Bonta &amp; Brakmar : Frères ennemis</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 17</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>,<span style="color: rgb(100, 181, 246);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Bontarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Bontarien</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 175&nbsp;</span>jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 201</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un juge hystérique" questid="84" questname="Un juge hystérique" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="42" class="tag-dungeon" id="33" type="dungeon" name="Garde-manger du Rat Blanc" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="42"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Garde-manger du Rat Blanc</span></span>1️⃣.</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Parlez au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Rat Blanc</span> à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Un juge hystérique" questid="84" questname="Un juge hystérique" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-29,-47]<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span>(<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>de <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Bonta</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et parlez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Chris de Naire.</span></p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="942" class="tag-monster" id="514" type="monster" name="Capoei Rat" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/522.png" dofusdbid="942"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/522.png" alt="monster"><span>Capoei Rat</span></span>.</p><p>Ne <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">capturez pas</span> le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="940" class="tag-monster" id="512" type="monster" name="Rat Blanc" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/520.png" dofusdbid="940"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/520.png" alt="monster"><span>Rat Blanc</span></span> pour le <span data