 guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="104" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP7] Ocre d''Ambre" label="[GP7] Ocre d''Ambre" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP7] Ocre d''Ambre</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> de l''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 13&nbsp;</span>jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 19</span> incluse.</p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="88" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP34] DOMAKURO" label="[GP34] DOMAKURO" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP34] DOMAKURO</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 30 </span>jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 34</span> incluse 1️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="125" class="tag-dungeon" id="112" type="dungeon" name="Bambusaie de Damadrya" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="125"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Bambusaie de Damadrya</span></span>2️⃣3️⃣(<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">F</span>aîtes les<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> 2 tâches&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">dans la </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">salle 4</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> puis parlez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Damadrya </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">à la </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> pour valider les étapes.</span></p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ A l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 33</span>, ne <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">suivez pas</span> le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chemin </span>à la <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fin </span>de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape</span> tant que vous n''avez pas avancé le ou les autres guides.</p><p>2️⃣ <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Validez </span>les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">quêtes </span><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">AVANT </span>de parler à la <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Lumière dorée</span> car elle vous expulsera hors du donjon.</p><p>3️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6322" class="tag-monster" id="3997" type="monster" name="Bulbiflore" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2085.png" dofusdbid="6322"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2085.png" alt="monster"><span>Bulbiflore</span></span> pour le succès monstre.</p>', 35, '[GP35] Pandala 1 : Villages + 100%', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 220, 2560, false, '{}', 65, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.601', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.601');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqr0f004pygogx01o12a5', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Ecaflipus 1.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif :</span> Ecaflipus 1.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>) <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="538" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP26] Ecaflipus 1" label="[GP26] Ecaflipus 1" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP26] Ecaflipus 1</span>1️⃣2️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Ce guide n''est <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">pas utile</span> à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">acquisition</span> du <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="8698" class="tag-item" id="3232" type="item" name="Dofus Nébuleux" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23016.png" dofusdbid="8698"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23016.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Nébuleux</span></span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur le<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="4278" class="tag-monster" id="2240" type="monster" name="Pounicheur" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1351.png" dofusdbid="4278"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1351.png" alt="monster"><span>Pounicheur</span></span> dans le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="93" class="tag-dungeon" id="80" type="dungeon" name="Miausolée du Pounicheur" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="93"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Miausolée du Pounicheur</span></span> pour le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">succès monstre</span>.</p>', 26, '[GP26] Ecaflipus 1', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 440, 2560, false, '{}', 66, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.623', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.623');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqr0o004rygogdu3unarv', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 110 à 120 🥩</p><p style="text-align: center;">🌽 Paysan/Alchimiste 90 à 100 🌽</p><p>Continuez de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">métier </span>jusqu''au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 100</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>de l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="423" class="tag-item" id="188" type="item" name="Lin" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34122.png" dofusdbid="423"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34122.png" alt="item"><span>Lin</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16432" class="tag-item" id="9440" type="item" name="Pain d''Épices" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33075.png" dofusdbid="16432"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33075.png" alt="item"><span>Pain d''Épices</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">paysan</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="593" class="tag-item" id="270" type="item" name="Orchidée Freyesque" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/35192.png" dofusdbid="593"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/35192.png" alt="item"><span>Orchidée Freyesque</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1713" class="tag-item" id="826" type="item" name="Potion Raide Boule" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12141.png" dofusdbid="1713"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12141.png" alt="item"><span>Potion Raide Boule</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alchimiste</span>.</p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 110 à 120 🥩</p><p>Pour monter le métier <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur niveau 120</span>, prévoyez :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>162 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17142" class="tag-item" id="9978" type="item" name="Viande Séchée" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63506.png" dofusdbid="17142"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63506.png" alt="item"><span>Viande Séchée</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>162 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="423" class="tag-item" id="188" type="item" name="Lin" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34122.png" dofusdbid="423"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34122.png" alt="item"><span>Lin</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>162 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6671" class="tag-item" id="1807" type="item" name="Haricot" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/58471.png" dofusdbid="6671"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/58471.png" alt="item"><span>Haricot</span></span> (ou 17 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16828" class="tag-item" id="9693" type="item" name="Sachet de Haricots" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180008.png" dofusdbid="16828"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180008.png" alt="item"><span>Sachet de Haricots</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17187" class="tag-item" id="10023" type="item" name="Pemmican aux Haricots" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69796.png" dofusdbid="17187"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69796.png" alt="item"><span>Pemmican aux Haricots</span></span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 660, 2560, true, '{}', 67, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.632', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.632');
