;">Brâkmar</span>) et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Kal Vissi</span>.</p></div>', 30, '[GP30] DDG-FRIGOST 1', NULL, '#f59e0b', 0, 2560, false, '{}', 68, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.637', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.637');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqr15004uygogrmy8tpzg', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'DOFUS POURPRE (étapes 1→14)', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="694" class="tag-item" id="313" type="item" name="Dofus Pourpre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23001.png" dofusdbid="694"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23001.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Pourpre</span></span> et Tour du Monde.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="1954" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP28] DOFUS POURPRE" label="[GP28] DOFUS POURPRE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP28] DOFUS POURPRE</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 11&nbsp;</span>jusqu''à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">l''étape 14</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Des donjons, encore des donjons" questid="85" questname="Des donjons, encore des donjons" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="4" class="tag-dungeon" id="3" type="dungeon" name="Centre du Labyrinthe du Minotoror" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="4"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Centre du Labyrinthe du Minotoror</span></span>1️⃣ et :</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Cliquez sur le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">trône</span> puis parlez au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Minotot </span>à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Des donjons, encore des donjons" questid="85" questname="Des donjons, encore des donjons" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-19,30] (<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>de <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Brâkmar</span>) et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Kal Vissi</span>.</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Lorkos </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">à la </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fin du donjon </span>pour entrer dans la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="53" class="tag-dungeon" id="44" type="dungeon" name="Salle du Minotot" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="53"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Salle du Minotot</span></span> et obtenir la <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">sauvegarde </span>avant de partir.</p><p>Ne <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">capturez pas</span> le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="121" class="tag-monster" id="67" type="monster" name="Minotoror" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/67.png" dofusdbid="121"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/67.png" alt="monster"><span>Minotoror</span></span> pour le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>, vous le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">ferez plus tard </span>en capturant le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="827" class="tag-monster" id="454" type="monster" nam