om/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP27] Xélorium 1</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="85" class="tag-dungeon" id="72" type="dungeon" name="Mégalithe de Fraktale" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="85"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Mégalithe de Fraktale</span></span>2️⃣ et</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Double cliquez</span> sur le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="15874" class="tag-item" id="8995" type="item" name="Détecteur portable" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15843.png" dofusdbid="15874"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15843.png" alt="item"><span>Détecteur portable</span></span>&nbsp;à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Vous ferez le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="46" class="tag-dungeon" id="37" type="dungeon" name="Repaire de Skeunk" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="46"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Repaire de Skeunk</span></span> une <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">première fois</span> à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 6 du GP61</span> puis une <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">seconde fois</span> à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 79 du GP0</span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>contre <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3852" class="tag-monster" id="1865" type="monster" name="Fraktale" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1224.png" dofusdbid="3852"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1224.png" alt="monster"><span>Fraktale</span></span> pour <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenir </span>le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">succès monstre</span>.</p><p>Vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtiendrez </span>ainsi 2 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="8072" class="tag-item" id="2759" type="item" name="Dofus Kaliptus" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23010.png" dofusdbid="8072"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23010.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Kaliptus</span></span> avec de la chance avoir un jet parfait !</p>', 61, '[GP61] Dofus Ébène', NULL, '#f59e0b', 0, 2880, false, '{}', 76, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.758', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.758');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqr4p005gygogq9qijvhp', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'Dofus Ébène', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7114" class="tag-item" id="2121" type="item" name="Dofus Ébène" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23007.png" dofusdbid="7114"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23007.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ébène</span></span> et Tour du Monde.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="705" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP61] Dofus Ébène" label="[GP61] Dofus Ébène" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP61] Dofus Ébène</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 12</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 31</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Des donjons, encore des donjons" questid="85" questname="Des donjons, encore des donjons" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7" class="tag-dungeon" id="5" type="dungeon" name="Antre de Crocabulia" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="7"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Antre de Crocabulia</span></span>1️⃣ (<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Crocabulia</span> à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Des donjons, encore des donjons" questid="85" questname="Des donjons, encore des donjons" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-19,30] (<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Zaap </span>de <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Brâkmar</span>) et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Kal Vissi.</span></p><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">allez en</span> [-6,-37] <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et parlez au </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Maître des clefs</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> pour finir </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="156" class="tag-quest" id="85" type="quest" name="Des donjons, encore des donjons" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="156"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Des donjons, encore des donjons</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="La voie du guerrier" questid="86" questname="La voie du guerrier" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="157" class="tag-quest" id="86" type="quest" name="La voie du guerrier" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="157"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>La voie du guerrier</span></span>.</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="5805" class="tag-monster" id="3557" type="monster" name="Dragmatique" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1902.png" dofusdbid="5805"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1902.png" alt="monster"><span>Dragmatique</span></span>.</p>', 61, '[GP61] Dofus Ébène', NULL, '#f59e0b', 220, 3040, false, '{}', 77, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.777', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.777');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqr51005iygogodwjv7so', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Tour du Monde.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif :</span> Tour du Monde.</p><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>) Prévoyez les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">ressources </span>suivantes :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>10 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="8075" class="tag-item" id="2761" type="item" name="Boomerang du Dok Alako" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15722.png" dofusdbid="8075"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15722.png" alt="item"><span>Boomerang du Dok Alako</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>10 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="8064" class="tag-item" id="2751" type="item" name="Boomerang du Koalak Sanguin" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15721.png" dofusdbid="8064"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15721.png" alt="item"><span>Boomerang du Koalak Sanguin</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>10 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="8076" class="tag-item" id="2762" type="item" name="Boomerang du Maître Koalak" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15723.png" dofusdbid="8076"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15723.png" alt="item"><span>Boomerang du Maître Koalak</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>10 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="8077" class="tag-item" id="2763" type="item" name="Boomerang du Warko Marron" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15724.png" dofusdbid="8077"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15724.png" alt="item"><span>Boomerang du Warko Marron</span></span></p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="La voie du guerrier" questid="86" questname="La voie du guerrier" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="46" class="tag-dungeon" id="37" type="dungeon" name="Repaire de Skeunk" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="46"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Repaire de Skeunk</span></span> (<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Parlez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Diamantine </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">à la </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> pour </span>obtenir <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le sort </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Boomerang perfide</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="La voie du guerrier" questid="86" questname="La voie du guerrier" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [-6,-37]<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et parlez au </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Maître des clefs</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p></div>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 440, 3040, false, '{}', 78, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.789', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.789');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqr57005jygogtatjgb6o', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🗡️ Mise à jour de l''équipement 🗡️</p><p>Pour la tranche de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 120-130</span>, allez sur le site : <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://huzounet.fr/equipments">https://huzounet.fr/equipments</a>.1️⃣2️⃣</p><p style="text-align: left;">Dans les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">filtres</span>, choisissez le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">mode PVM</span>, votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">classe</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">élément</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">libre </span>de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">mettre </span>des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">trophées </span>ou de prendre une <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">dragodinde</span>.</p><p>2️⃣ <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Prévoyez d''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">FM</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> vos </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">items </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">pour </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">augmenter votre vitalité maximale</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Pensez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">FM </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">votre </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">arme </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">avec </span>une <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="10057" class="tag-item" id="4249" type="item" name="Rune de chasse" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/78059.png" dofusdbid="10057"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/78059.png" alt="item"><span>Rune de chasse</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur</span>.</p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 660, 3040, true, '{}', 79, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.795', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.795');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqr5e005kygogksn3vxep', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 120 à 130 🥩</p><p style="text-align: center;">🌽 Paysan/Alchimiste 100 à 110 🌽</p><p>Continuez de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">métier </span>jusqu''au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 110</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>du <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="532" class="tag-item" id="256" type="item" name="Seigle" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34083.png" dofusdbid="532"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34083.png" alt="item"><span>Seigle</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="539" class="tag-item" id="261" type="item" name="Pain de Seigle" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33009.png" dofusdbid="539"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33009.png" alt="item"><span>Pain de Seigle</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">paysan</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="594" class="tag-item" id="271" type="item" name="Edelweiss" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/35191.png" dofusdbid="594"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/35191.png" alt="item"><span>Edelweiss</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1406" class="tag-item" id="641" type="item" name="Sang de Likrone" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12040.png" dofusdbid="1406"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12040.png" alt="item"><span>Sang de Likrone</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alchimiste</span>.</p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 120 à 130 🥩</p><p style="text-align: left;">Pour monter le métier <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur niveau 130</span>, prévoyez :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>161 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17144" class="tag-item" id="9980" type="item" name="Viande Saignante" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63453.png" dofusdbid="17144"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63453.png" alt="item"><span>Viande Saignante</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>161 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="532" class="tag-item" id="256" type="item" name="Seigle" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34561.png" dofusdbid="532"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34561.png" alt="item"><span>Seigle</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>161 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1984" class="tag-item" id="989" type="item" name="Cendres Éternelles" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/48671.png" dofusdbid="1984"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/48671.png" alt="item"><span>Cendres Éternelles</span></span> (ou 17 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16820" class="tag-item" id="9685" type="item" name="Sachet de Cendres Éternelles" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180002.png" dofusdbid="16820"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180002.png" alt="item"><span>Sachet de Cendres Éternelles</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17189" class="tag-item" id="10025" type="item" name="Grillade Brâkmarienne" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69785.png" dofusdbid="17189"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69785.png" alt="item"><span>Grillade Brâkmarienne</span></span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 0, 3040, true, '{}', 80, '2026-05-02 12:06:58.802', '2026-05-02 12:06:58.802');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqr5l005lygogz997z985', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="23237" class="tag-item" id="14858" type="item" name="Domakuro" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23032.png" dofusdbid="23237"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23032.png" alt="item"><span>Domakuro</span></span>, Pandala 1, Alignement et Tour du Monde.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><p>Pour cette étape, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avancez </span>les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">3 guides </span>jusqu''à atteindre l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="126" class="tag-dungeon" id="113" type="dungeon" name="Atelier du Tanukouï San" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="126"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Atelier du Tanukouï San</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>,<span style="color: rgb(100, 181, 246);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Bontarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Bontarien</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 276</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 283</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>