tom-tag" data-id="53" class="tag-dungeon" id="44" type="dungeon" name="Salle du Minotot" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="53"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Salle du Minotot</span></span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Pour <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chaque tentative</span> contre un boss, il faut<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> double cliquer</span> sur l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">idole</span> avant le combat.</p><p>3️⃣ L''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 61</span> est sautée pour le moment, l''on y reviendra plus tard.</p>', 36, '[GP36] Otomaï 3', NULL, '#f59e0b', 660, 3680, false, '{}', 95, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.046', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.046');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrcn006pygogs7whl7yb', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 150 à 160 🥩</p><p style="text-align: center;">🌽 Paysan/Alchimiste 130 à 140 🌽</p><p style="text-align: left;">Continuez de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">métier </span>jusqu''au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 140</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>du <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="405" class="tag-item" id="170" type="item" name="Malt" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34561.png" dofusdbid="405"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34561.png" alt="item"><span>Malt</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="520" class="tag-item" id="249" type="item" name="Borodinski" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33010.png" dofusdbid="520"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33010.png" alt="item"><span>Borodinski</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">paysan</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7059" class="tag-item" id="2080" type="item" name="Graine de Pandouille" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/58067.png" dofusdbid="7059"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/58067.png" alt="item"><span>Graine de Pandouille</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16412" class="tag-item" id="9430" type="item" name="Potion Raide Emption" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12752.png" dofusdbid="16412"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12752.png" alt="item"><span>Potion Raide Emption</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alchimiste</span>.</p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 150 à 160 🥩</p><p>Pour monter le métier <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur niveau 160</span>, prévoyez :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>159 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17150" class="tag-item" id="9986" type="item" name="Viande de Brousse" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63372.png" dofusdbid="17150"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63372.png" alt="item"><span>Viande de Brousse</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>159 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="405" class="tag-item" id="170" type="item" name="Malt" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34083.png" dofusdbid="405"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34083.png" alt="item"><span>Malt</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>159 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1977" class="tag-item" id="983" type="item" name="Épices" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15378.png" dofusdbid="1977"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15378.png" alt="item"><span>Épices</span></span> (ou 16 <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16825" class="tag-item" id="9690" type="item" name="Sachet d''Épices" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180005.png" dofusdbid="16825"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180005.png" alt="item"><span>Sachet d''Épices</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17195" class="tag-item" id="10031" type="item" name="Daube aux Épices" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69801.png" dofusdbid="17195"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69801.png" alt="item"><span>Daube aux Épices</span></span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 0, 3680, true, '{}', 96, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.063', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.063');
