INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrdu006wygogf8523h4v', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'Cania 3,', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Cania 3, <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="739" class="tag-item" id="345" type="item" name="Dofus Turquoise" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" dofusdbid="739"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Turquoise</span></span> et Alignement.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Bontarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Bontarien</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 363</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 387</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vou</span>s êtes <span style="color: rgb(235, 65, 101);">brâkmarien</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="773" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 304</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 341</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>)&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="736" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP39] Cania 3 : La voyageuse imprudente" label="[GP39] Cania 3 : La voyageuse imprudente" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP39] Cania 3 : La voyageuse imprudente</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="75" class="tag-dungeon" id="63" type="dungeon" name="Grotte de Kanigroula" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="75"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Grotte de Kanigroula</span></span>1️⃣&nbsp;avec l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="28452" class="tag-item" id="18568" type="item" name="Idole de Foluk Griffée" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/178116.png" dofusdbid="28452"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/178116.png" alt="item"><span>Idole de Foluk Griffée</span></span>2️⃣.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Kanigroula </span>à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>&nbsp;si vous faites le guide (<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>).</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3557" class="tag-monster" id="1593" type="monster" name="Kanihilan" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1067.png" dofusdbid="3557"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1067.png" alt="monster"><span>Kanihilan</span></span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Pour <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chaque tentative</span> contre un boss, il faut<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> double cliquer</span> sur l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">idole</span> avant le combat.</p>', 9, '[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN', NULL, '#f59e0b', 0, 3840, false, '{}', 100, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.106', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.106');
