INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrgj007bygogh42l5qik', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Saharach 3.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Saharach 3.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>)&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide</span><span style="color: rgb(121, 134, 204);"> </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="1237" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP55] Saharach 3" label="[GP55] Saharach 3" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP55] Saharach 3</span>1️⃣ jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 30&nbsp;</span>incluse.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="4727" class="tag-monster" id="2320" type="monster" name="Pikténia" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1534.png" dofusdbid="4727"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1534.png" alt="monster"><span>Pikténia</span></span> dans le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="102" class="tag-dungeon" id="89" type="dungeon" name="Boyau du Père Ver" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="102"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Boyau du Père Ver</span></span>.</p>', 55, '[GP55] Saharach 3', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 220, 4160, false, '{}', 105, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.203', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.203');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrgv007dygogcswuey77', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🗡️ Mise à jour de l''équipement 🗡️</p><p>Pour la tranche de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 180-190</span>, allez sur le site : <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://huzounet.fr/equipments">https://huzounet.fr/equipments</a>.1️⃣2️⃣</p><p style="text-align: left;">Dans les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">filtres</span>, choisissez le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">mode PVM</span>, votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">classe</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">élément</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">libre </span>de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">mettre </span>des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">trophées </span>ou de prendre une <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">dragodinde</span>.</p><p>2️⃣ <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Prévoyez d''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">FM</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> vos </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">items </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">pour </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">augmenter votre vitalité maximale</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Pensez à </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">FM </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">votre </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">arme </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">avec </span>une <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="10057" class="tag-item" id="4249" type="item" name="Rune de chasse" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/78059.png" dofusdbid="10057"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/78059.png" alt="item"><span>Rune de chasse</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur</span>.</p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 440, 4160, true, '{}', 106, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.215', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.215');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrh0007eygogxhobqbki', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 170 à 180 🥩</p><p style="text-align: center;">🌽 Paysan/Alchimiste 150 à 160 🌽</p><p style="text-align: left;">Continuez de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">métier </span>jusqu''au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 160</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>du <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="425" class="tag-item" id="190" type="item" name="Chanvre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34121.png" dofusdbid="425"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34121.png" alt="item"><span>Chanvre</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="527" class="tag-item" id="254" type="item" name="Mantou" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33014.png" dofusdbid="527"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33014.png" alt="item"><span>Mantou</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">paysan</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16385" class="tag-item" id="9413" type="item" name="Ginseng" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36644.png" dofusdbid="16385"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36644.png" alt="item"><span>Ginseng</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16414" class="tag-item" id="9432" type="item" name="Potion Raide Izdaide" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12753.png" dofusdbid="16414"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12753.png" alt="item"><span>Potion Raide Izdaide</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alchimiste</span>.</p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 170 à 180 🥩</p><p>Pour monter le métier <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur niveau 180</span>, prévoyez :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>159&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17154" class="tag-item" id="9990" type="item" name="Viande Maigre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63391.png" dofusdbid="17154"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63391.png" alt="item"><span>Viande Maigre</span></span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>318&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="425" class="tag-item" id="190" type="item" name="Chanvre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34121.png" dofusdbid="425"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34121.png" alt="item"><span>Chanvre</span></span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>159&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="519" class="tag-item" id="248" type="item" name="Poudre de Perlinpainpain" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/48002.png" dofusdbid="519"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/48002.png" alt="item"><span>Poudre de Perlinpainpain</span></span>&nbsp;(ou 17&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16833" class="tag-item" id="9698" type="item" name="Sachet de Poudre de Perlinpainpain" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180012.png" dofusdbid="16833"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180012.png" alt="item"><span>Sachet de Poudre de Perlinpainpain</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17199" class="tag-item" id="10035" type="item" name="Filet Mignon" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69733.png" dofusdbid="17199"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69733.png" alt="item"><span>Filet Mignon</span></span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 660, 4160, true, '{}', 107, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.22', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.22');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrh6007fygogdiy86tmy', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'DDG-FRIGOST 2', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs : </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7043" class="tag-item" id="2067" type="item" name="Dofus des Glaces" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23005.png" dofusdbid="7043"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23005.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus des Glaces</span></span> - Partie 2, <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="739" class="tag-item" id="345" type="item" name="Dofus Turquoise" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" dofusdbid="739"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Turquoise</span></span>, Alignement et Prérequis du <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="29134" class="tag-item" id="18869" type="item" name="Dofus Sylvestre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23036.png" dofusdbid="29134"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23036.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Sylvestre</span></span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><p>Pour cette étape, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avancez </span>les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">3 guides </span>jusqu''à atteindre l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="59" class="tag-dungeon" id="50" type="dungeon" name="Antre du Korriandre" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="59"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Antre du Korriandre</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="112" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP43] DDG-FRIGOST 2" label="[GP43] DDG-FRIGOST 2" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP43] DDG-FRIGOST 2</span> jusqu''à l<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">''étape 32</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="2042" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP86] L''ARBRE QUI CACHE LA FORÊT" label="[GP86] L''ARBRE QUI CACHE LA FORÊT" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP86] L''ARBRE QUI CACHE LA FORÊT</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 33</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 48</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Attention ne sortez pas à la fin du donjon !</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>,<span style="color: rgb(100, 181, 246);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 477</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 602</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Attention ! </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Ne faites pas</span> les quêtes d''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Ordre 4</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">de l''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 507</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> à l''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 533</span>.<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> Elles ne sont pas bloquantes alors continuez depuis l''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 534</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si v</span>ous êtes <span style="color: rgb(235, 65, 101);">brâkmarien</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="773" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN" label="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 341</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 525</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Attention ! </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Ne faites pas</span> les quêtes d''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Ordre 4</span> <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">de l''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 450</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> à l''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 478</span>.<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> Elles ne sont pas bloquantes alors continuez depuis l''</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 479</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="59" class="tag-dungeon" id="50" type="dungeon" name="Antre du Korriandre" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="59"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Antre du Korriandre</span></span> avec l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="28453" class="tag-item" id="18569" type="item" name="Idole de Foluk Féérique" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/178117.png" dofusdbid="28453"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/178117.png" alt="item"><span>Idole de Foluk Féérique</span></span>1️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Pour <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chaque tentative</span> contre un boss, il faut<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> double cliquer</span> sur l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">idole</span> avant le combat.</p>', 43, '[GP43] DDG-FRIGOST 2', NULL, '#f59e0b', 0, 4160, false, '{}', 108, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.226', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.226');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrhr007jygogs63yyvsq', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'DOFUS TURQUOISE', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="739" class="tag-item" id="345" type="item" name="Dofus Turquoise" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" dofusdbid="739"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Turquoise</span></span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> et Sidimote 3.</span></p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="131" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE" label="[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE</span>&nbsp;depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 72</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>)&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span>le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="429" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP45] Sidimote 3 : Le double effet Gisgoul" label="[GP45] Sidimote 3 : Le double effet Gisgoul" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP45] Sidimote 3 : Le double effet Gisgoul</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations ! </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">En terminant le&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="131" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE" label="[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE</span>, vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span>le&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="739" class="tag-item" id="345" type="item" name="Dofus Turquoise" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" dofusdbid="739"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23003.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Turquoise</span></span>.</p>', 33, '[GP33] DOFUS TURQUOISE', NULL, '#f59e0b', 220, 4320, false, '{}', 109, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.247', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.247');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqri6007mygogieg3hohx', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'Tour du Monde.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif :</span> Tour du Monde.</p><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="La voie du guerrier" questid="86" questname="La voie du guerrier" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="14" class="tag-dungeon" id="11" type="dungeon" name="Grotte du Bworker" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="14"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Grotte du Bworker</span></span>1️⃣&nbsp;(<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>).</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="La voie du guerrier" questid="86" questname="La voie du guerrier" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span>[-6,-37] et<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> parlez au </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Maître des clefs</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> pour mettre à jour&nbsp;</span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="157" class="tag-quest" id="86" type="quest" name="La voie du guerrier" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="157"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>La voie du guerrier</span></span>.</p><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">allez en</span> [6,-18] et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Metag Robill </span>pour finir&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="157" class="tag-quest" id="86" type="quest" name="La voie du guerrier" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="157"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>La voie du guerrier</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Le tracas du guerrier" questid="620" questname="Le tracas du guerrier" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="893" class="tag-quest" id="620" type="quest" name="Le tracas du guerrier" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="893"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Le tracas du guerrier</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Le tracas du guerrier" questid="620" questname="Le tracas du guerrier" status="end"><p>Enfin&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">allez en</span> [-6,-37] et parlez au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Maître des clefs</span> pour finir&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="893" class="tag-quest" id="620" type="quest" name="Le tracas du guerrier" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="893"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Le tracas du guerrier</span></span>.</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations !</span> Vous terminez le succès : <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Le Tour du monde en 27 donjons</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="488" class="tag-monster" id="289" type="monster" name="Cybwork" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/266.png" dofusdbid="488"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/266.png" alt="monster"><span>Cybwork</span></span>.</p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#f59e0b', 440, 4320, false, '{}', 110, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.263', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.263');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrie007nygog7m5qjpm5', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Sidimote 4 et Alignement.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs : </span>Sidimote 4 et Alignement.</p><p>Pour cette étape, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avancez </span>les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2 guides </span>jusqu''à atteindre le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="22" class="tag-dungeon" id="17" type="dungeon" name="Temple du Grand Ougah" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="22"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Temple du Grand Ougah</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>)&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span>le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="604" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP46] Sidimote 4 : Les spores, c''est la santé" label="[GP46] Sidimote 4 : Les spores, c''est la santé" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP46] Sidimote 4 : Les spores, c''est la santé</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>,<span style="color: rgb(100, 181, 246);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Bontarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Bontarien</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 507</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 533</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vou</span>s êtes <span style="color: rgb(235, 65, 101);">brâkmarien</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="773" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien</span> de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 450&nbsp;</span>jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 478</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour de force" questid="642" questname="Tour de force" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="22" class="tag-dungeon" id="17" type="dungeon" name="Temple du Grand Ougah" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="22"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Temple du Grand Ougah</span></span>&nbsp;(<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>) et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Cliquez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">sur </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">les objectifs</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span>dans les <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">salles </span>du donjon si vous faites le guide (<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>).</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour de force" questid="642" questname="Tour de force" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [16,27] et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Lorie Culère </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">pour finir</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="916" class="tag-quest" id="642" type="quest" name="Tour de force" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="916"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Tour de force</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour nage" questid="643" questname="Tour nage" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="917" class="tag-quest" id="643" type="quest" name="Tour nage" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="917"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Tour nage</span></span>.</p></div>', 46, '[GP46] Sidimote 4 : Les spores, c''est la santé', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 660, 4320, false, '{}', 111, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.27', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.27');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqriy007qygog08ghbzxw', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Srambad 2', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif :</span> Srambad 2</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span>le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="481" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP47] Srambad 2" label="[GP47] Srambad 2" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP47] Srambad 2</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="82" class="tag-dungeon" id="69" type="dungeon" name="Cave du Toxoliath" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="82"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Cave du Toxoliath</span></span>1️⃣2️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites le succès : <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Circulez !</span> contre le&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3752" class="tag-monster" id="1767" type="monster" name="Toxoliath" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1166.png" dofusdbid="3752"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1166.png" alt="monster"><span>Toxoliath</span></span>&nbsp;pour <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">débloquer </span>un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">prérequis </span>du guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="482" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP63] Srambad 3" label="[GP63] Srambad 3" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP63] Srambad 3</span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Si possible faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>pour le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">succès monstre</span>.</p>', 47, '[GP47] Srambad 2', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 0, 4320, false, '{}', 112, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.29', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.29');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrje007tygogf49w9r2w', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 180 à 190 🥩</p><p style="text-align: center;">🌽 Paysan/Alchimiste 160 à 170 🌽</p><p>Continuez de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monter </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">métier </span>jusqu''au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 170</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>du <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16454" class="tag-item" id="9451" type="item" name="Maïs" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34554.png" dofusdbid="16454"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34554.png" alt="item"><span>Maïs</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16437" class="tag-item" id="9445" type="item" name="Tortilla" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33080.png" dofusdbid="16437"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/33080.png" alt="item"><span>Tortilla</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">paysan</span>.</p><p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Récupérez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16387" class="tag-item" id="9415" type="item" name="Belladone" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/35638.png" dofusdbid="16387"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/35638.png" alt="item"><span>Belladone</span></span> et/ou <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16415" class="tag-item" id="9433" type="item" name="Larme d''Eniripsa" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12755.png" dofusdbid="16415"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12755.png" alt="item"><span>Larme d''Eniripsa</span></span> si vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">alchimiste</span>.</p><p style="text-align: center;">🥩 Chasseur 180 à 190 🥩</p><p>Pour monter le métier <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">chasseur niveau 190</span>, prévoyez :</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>158&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17156" class="tag-item" id="9992" type="item" name="Viande Gâtée" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63533.png" dofusdbid="17156"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63533.png" alt="item"><span>Viande Gâtée</span></span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>316&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16454" class="tag-item" id="9451" type="item" name="Maïs" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34554.png" dofusdbid="16454"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34554.png" alt="item"><span>Maïs</span></span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>158&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="1986" class="tag-item" id="991" type="item" name="Poudre Temporelle" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/48002.png" dofusdbid="1986"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/48002.png" alt="item"><span>Poudre Temporelle</span></span>&nbsp;ou (16&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="16834" class="tag-item" id="9699" type="item" name="Sachet de Poudre Temporelle" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180013.png" dofusdbid="16834"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/180013.png" alt="item"><span>Sachet de Poudre Temporelle</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="17201" class="tag-item" id="10037" type="item" name="Quenelle Tijan" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69867.png" dofusdbid="17201"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/69867.png" alt="item"><span>Quenelle Tijan</span></span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.</span></p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 220, 4480, true, '{}', 113, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.306', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.306');
