des Gloursons</span></span>2️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces </span>:&nbsp;</p><p>1️⃣ Faites un&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2884" class="tag-monster" id="1141" type="monster" name="Blérom" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/799.png" dofusdbid="2884"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/799.png" alt="monster"><span>Blérom</span></span>&nbsp;pour le succès monstre.</p><p>2️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2987" class="tag-monster" id="1220" type="monster" name="Glourmand" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/850.png" dofusdbid="2987"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/850.png" alt="monster"><span>Glourmand</span></span>&nbsp;pour le succès monstre.</p>', 43, '[GP43] DDG-FRIGOST 2', NULL, '#f59e0b', 440, 4480, false, '{}', 114, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.313', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.313');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrjx007wygog51lss2b0', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Alignement.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif : </span>Alignement.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Bontarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Bontarien</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 602</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 648</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vou</span>s êtes <span style="color: rgb(235, 65, 101);">brâkmarien</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="773" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 525</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 563</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6