5, 255, 0);">Missiz Frizz</span> à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :&nbsp;</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>contre un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3390" class="tag-monster" id="1437" type="monster" name="Frimar" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/969.png" dofusdbid="3390"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/969.png" alt="monster"><span>Frimar</span></span>&nbsp;pour le succès monstre.</p>', 50, '[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3', NULL, '#f59e0b', 440, 4800, false, '{}', 122, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.41', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.41');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrmr008eygogfs0498m7', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'DDG-FRIGOST 3', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif :</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7043" class="tag-item" id="2067" type="item" name="Dofus des Glaces" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23005.png" dofusdbid="7043"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23005.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus des Glaces</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez</span> le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="113" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3" label="[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3</span>1️⃣&nbsp;depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 84</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>)&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="3238" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP89] 100% FRIGOST" label="[GP89] 100% FRIGOST" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP89] 100% FRIGOST</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="71" class="tag-dungeon" id="59" type="dungeon" name="Donjon du Comte Harebourg" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="71"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Donjon du Comte Harebourg</span></span>2️⃣3️⃣.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations !</span>&nbsp;En terminant le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="113" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3" label="[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3</span>, vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span>le&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7043" class="tag-item" id="2067" type="item" name="Dofus des Glaces" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23005.png" dofusdbid="7043"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23005.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus des Glaces</span></span><span style="color: rgb(243, 244, 246); background-color: rgb(31, 41, 55);">4️⃣</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Prenez l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avis de recherche</span> du&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3416" class="tag-monster" id="1463" type="monster" name="Comte Harebourg" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/993.png" dofusdbid="3416"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/993.png" alt="monster"><span>Comte Harebourg</span></span>&nbsp;avant le donjon en [-68,-76].</p><p>2️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3411" class="tag-monster" id="1458" type="monster" name="Strigide" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/988.png" dofusdbid="3411"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/988.png" alt="monster"><span>Strigide</span></span> pour le succès monstre.</p><p>3️⃣ Prenez le temps d''assimiler les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">mécaniques </span>du&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="3416" class="tag-monster" id="1463" type="monster" name="Comte Harebourg" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/993.png" dofusdbid="3416"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/993.png" alt="monster"><span>Comte Harebourg</span></span> via les aides du guide ou des ressources vidéos.</p><p>4️⃣ Le guide<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="3238" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP89] 100% FRIGOST" label="[GP89] 100% FRIGOST" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP89] 100% FRIGOST</span> est un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">guide </span>qui se fait <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">sur le long terme</span>, même s''il est indiqué de le finir, vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">pouvez </span>le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">faire plus tard</span>. Il ne <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">bloque pas</span> votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">progression</span>.</p>', 50, '[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3', NULL, '#f59e0b', 660, 4800, false, '{}', 123, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.427', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.427');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrn8008hygogja0583i1', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Alignement.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif : </span>Alignement.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vous êtes </span><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">bontarien</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Bontarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Bontarien</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 718</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 734</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Si vou</span>s êtes <span style="color: rgb(235, 65, 101);">brâkmarien</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">, </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">reprenez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide</span> <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="773" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien</span>&nbsp;de l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 636</span> jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 653</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="107" class="tag-dungeon" id="94" type="dungeon" name="Belvédère d''Ilyzaelle" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="107"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Belvédère d''Ilyzaelle</span></span>1️⃣ et</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Ilyzaelle </span>à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuce :&nbsp;</span></p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur une&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="4968" class="tag-monster" id="2537" type="monster" name="Chause" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1629.png" dofusdbid="4968"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1629.png" alt="monster"><span>Chause</span></span>&nbsp;pour le succès monstre.</p>', 9, '[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 0, 4800, false, '{}', 124, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.444', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.444');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrnj008jygogpd61a7j9', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DONJON', 'Alignement et Tour du Monde.', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Alignement et Tour du Monde.</p><p>Pour cette étape, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avancez </span>les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2 guides </span>jusqu''à atteindre l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="73" class="tag-dungeon" id="61" type="dungeon" name="Aquadôme de Merkator" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="73"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Aquadôme de Merkator</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="516" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Bontarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Bontarien</span> ou le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="773" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BRÂKMARIEN" label="[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP9] Alignement Brâkmarien</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>)&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="430" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP23] Justiciers et plus" label="[GP23] Justiciers et plus" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP23] Justiciers et plus</span>&nbsp;depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 30</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour nage" questid="643" questname="Tour nage" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="73" class="tag-dungeon" id="61" type="dungeon" name="Aquadôme de Merkator" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="73"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Aquadôme de Merkator</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Tour nage" questid="643" questname="Tour nage" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span> [16,27] et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Lorie Culère </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">pour finir</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="917" class="tag-quest" id="643" type="quest" name="Tour nage" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="917"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Tour nage</span></span>.</p></div><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Le tour est joué" questid="644" questname="Le tour est joué" status="start"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Continuez </span>de lui <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="918" class="tag-quest" id="644" type="quest" name="Le tour est joué" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="918"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Le tour est joué</span></span>.</p></div>', 9, '[GP9] ALIGNEMENT BONTARIEN', NULL, '#8b5cf6', 220, 4960, false, '{}', 125, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.455', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.455');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqro0008mygog2uo6o9eh', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'PREREQUIS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🗡️ Mise à jour de l''équipement 🗡️</p><p>Pour le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">niveau 200</span>, vous êtes <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">libre </span>de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">faire </span>ce que <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">vous voulez</span>.</p><p>Selon vos <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Kamas</span>, prenez des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Exos PA/PM</span> ou partez plutôt sur un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">équipement low cost</span> sans <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span> et<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6980" class="tag-item" id="2015" type="item" name="Dofus Vulbis" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png" dofusdbid="6980"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Vulbis</span></span>.</p><p>Vous pouvez <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">continuer </span>de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">suivre </span>le site : <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://huzounet.fr/equipments?level=199">https://huzounet.fr/equipments?level=199</a>.</p><p>Sinon <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">utilisez </span>le site <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.dofusbook.net/fr/">https://www.dofusbook.net/fr/</a> pour <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">faire </span>vos <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">équipements vous même</span>.</p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#a855f7', 440, 4960, true, '{}', 126, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.472', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.472');
