INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrus009rygogkpo88l4a', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'Crocuzko et', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs :</span> Crocuzko et <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6980" class="tag-item" id="2015" type="item" name="Dofus Vulbis" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png" dofusdbid="6980"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Vulbis</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="1138" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP65] Crocuzko" label="[GP65] Crocuzko" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP65] Crocuzko</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="114" class="tag-dungeon" id="101" type="dungeon" name="Sanctuaire de Torkélonia" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="114"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Sanctuaire de Torkélonia</span></span>1️⃣ et</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Parlez au <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Porte-voix de Torkélonia</span> à la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">fin du donjon</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p>Si vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">n''avez pas</span>&nbsp;le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="21189" class="tag-item" id="13404" type="item" name="Parangon de puissance" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/50733.png" dofusdbid="21189"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/50733.png" alt="item"><span>Parangon de puissance</span></span>, allez le <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">drop </span>sur les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">donjons </span>que<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> vous préférez</span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Une fois obtenu, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span>le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="704" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP67] Dofus Vulbis" label="[GP67] Dofus Vulbis" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP67] Dofus Vulbis</span>&nbsp;depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 10</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations ! </span>En terminant le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="704" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP67] Dofus Vulbis" label="[GP67] Dofus Vulbis" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP67] Dofus Vulbis</span>, vous&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6980" class="tag-item" id="2015" type="item" name="Dofus Vulbis" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png" dofusdbid="6980"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Vulbis</span></span>.</p><p>Astuce :&nbsp;</p><p>1️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>sur un&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="5807" class="tag-monster" id="3559" type="monster" name="Kashkaille" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1904.png" dofusdbid="5807"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1904.png" alt="monster"><span>Kashkaille</span></span>&nbsp;pour le succès monstre.</p>', 65, '[GP65] Crocuzko', NULL, '#f59e0b', 220, 5600, false, '{}', 141, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.716', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.716');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrve009uygog63kx1n1r', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'Eliocalypse Résonance et Prérequis du', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif : </span>Eliocalypse Résonance et Prérequis du <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="26066" class="tag-item" id="16395" type="item" name="Dofus du Cauchemar" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23034.png" dofusdbid="26066"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23034.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus du Cauchemar</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="1714" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP66] Eliocalypse Résonance" label="[GP66] Eliocalypse Résonance" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP66] Eliocalypse Résonance</span>&nbsp;depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 26</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>le guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="1914" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP78] L''AVENIR DU FUTUR" label="[GP78] L''AVENIR DU FUTUR" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP78] L''AVENIR DU FUTUR</span>&nbsp;jusqu''à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 22</span> incluse.</p></div></li></ul>', 66, '[GP66] Eliocalypse Résonance', NULL, '#f59e0b', 440, 5600, false, '{}', 142, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.738', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.738');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrvy009xygog3db89eji', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'DOFUS TACHETE', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectifs : </span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7112" class="tag-item" id="2119" type="item" name="Dofus Tacheté" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23008.png" dofusdbid="7112"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23008.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Tacheté</span></span> et Pandala 3.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Lisez bien toute l''étape avant de la faire !</span></p><p>Pour cette étape, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">avancez </span>les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2 guides </span>jusqu''à atteindre la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="133" class="tag-dungeon" id="116" type="dungeon" name="Mémoire d''Orukam" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="133"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Mémoire d''Orukam</span></span>&nbsp;et le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="134" class="tag-dungeon" id="117" type="dungeon" name="Souvenir d''Imagiro" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="134"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Souvenir d''Imagiro</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">et </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide</span><span style="color: rgb(121, 134, 204);"> </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="1867" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP68] DOFUS TACHETE" label="[GP68] DOFUS TACHETE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP68] DOFUS TACHETE</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>)&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Commencez </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminez&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">le guide </span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="2050" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP69] PANDALA 3" label="[GP69] PANDALA 3" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP69] PANDALA 3</span>1️⃣2️⃣.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>la <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="133" class="tag-dungeon" id="116" type="dungeon" name="Mémoire d''Orukam" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="133"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Mémoire d''Orukam</span></span>3️⃣&nbsp;et le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="134" class="tag-dungeon" id="117" type="dungeon" name="Souvenir d''Imagiro" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="134"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Souvenir d''Imagiro</span></span>3️⃣ et&nbsp;</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>Aux <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étapes 49 et 50</span>, parlez aux <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">PNJ </span>dans les donjons.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p>A l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 123</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;du guide&nbsp;</span>(<span style="color: rgb(170, 71, 188);">Optionnel</span>), <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">maximisez </span>votre <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">prospection </span>pour drop dans les donjons.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations !</span>&nbsp;En terminant le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="1867" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP68] DOFUS TACHETE" label="[GP68] DOFUS TACHETE" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP68] DOFUS TACHETE</span>, vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span>le <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7112" class="tag-item" id="2119" type="item" name="Dofus Tacheté" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23008.png" dofusdbid="7112"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23008.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Tacheté</span></span>.</p><p>En faisant tous les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">succès </span>des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">donjons</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">quêtes</span>, <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">monstres </span>et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">explorations </span>de <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Pandala 3</span>, vous obtenez l''ornement :<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&nbsp;D''encre et de papier</span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Le succès :&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Les secrets du Pandawushu</span> vous oblige à faire<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> une quête par jour</span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Puis la quête&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2203" class="tag-quest" id="1853" type="quest" name="Tant de mots et si peu de temps" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="2203"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Tant de mots et si peu de temps</span></span>&nbsp;vous demandera de <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">récupérer </span>des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Haïkus </span>ce qui vous prendra des jours.</p><p>Vous pouvez <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">mettre en pause</span> ce guide <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">une fois</span> que vous avez <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">drop</span> les&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Haïkus du dragon</span>&nbsp;à l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 123</span>.</p><p>3️⃣ Faites un <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">challenge </span>pour les succès monstre pour chaque donjon.</p>', 68, '[GP68] DOFUS TACHETE', NULL, '#f59e0b', 660, 5600, false, '{}', 143, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.758', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.758');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrwi00a0ygogmhfq8o28', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', 'DOFUS OCRE', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Objectif :</span> <span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>.</p><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">l''</span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="439" class="tag-quest" id="263" type="quest" name="L''éternelle moisson" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="439"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>L''éternelle moisson</span></span>&nbsp;du guide&nbsp;<span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="182" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP8] DOFUS OCRE" label="[GP8] DOFUS OCRE" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP8] DOFUS OCRE</span>.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Le tour est joué" questid="644" questname="Le tour est joué" status="in_progress"><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Réalisez </span>l''<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="31" class="tag-dungeon" id="23" type="dungeon" name="Antre du Kralamoure Géant" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" dofusdbid="31"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png" alt="dungeon"><span>Antre du Kralamoure Géant</span></span>&nbsp;et</p></div><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Equipez </span>la&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="9718" class="tag-item" id="4013" type="item" name="Gargantuesque pierre d''âme parfaite" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/83024.png" dofusdbid="9718"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/83024.png" alt="item"><span>Gargantuesque pierre d''âme parfaite</span></span>&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">AVANT </span>le boss.</p></div></li></ul><div data-type="quest-block" class="quest-block" title="Le tour est joué" questid="644" questname="Le tour est joué" status="end"><p><span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">Allez en</span>&nbsp;[16,27] et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Lorie Culère </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">pour mettre à jour&nbsp;</span><span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="918" class="tag-quest" id="644" type="quest" name="Le tour est joué" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="918"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Le tour est joué</span></span>.</p><p>Ensuite <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">allez en</span>&nbsp;[1-15] et parlez à <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Emma Tompouce</span> pour finir&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="918" class="tag-quest" id="644" type="quest" name="Le tour est joué" imageurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="918"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Le tour est joué</span></span>.</p></div><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations ! </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">En terminant le guide&nbsp;</span><span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="182" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP8] DOFUS OCRE" label="[GP8] DOFUS OCRE" baseurl="https://ganymede-app.com"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP8] DOFUS OCRE</span>, vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span>le&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations !</span> Vous avez <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">terminé&nbsp;</span>le&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Tour du monde d''Emma Tompouce</span>.</p>', 8, '[GP8] DOFUS OCRE', NULL, '#f59e0b', 0, 5600, false, '{}', 144, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.778', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.778');
INSERT INTO public."GuideMilestone" VALUES ('cmooaqrwt00a2ygog7uby0tdl', 'cmolc84qt0000noogp0gr4sjj', 'DOFUS', '👉 Étape bonus 👈', NULL, '<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);"><strong>👉 Étape bonus 👈</strong></span></p><p style="text-align: center;">🗡️ Mise à jour de l''équipement 🗡️</p><p>Avec l''obtention du&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="6980" class="tag-item" id="2015" type="item" name="Dofus Vulbis" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png" dofusdbid="6980"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Vulbis</span></span>&nbsp;et du&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="7754" class="tag-item" id="2502" type="item" name="Dofus Ocre" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" dofusdbid="7754"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span>, prenez des <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">équipements full opti </span>avec <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">12 PA</span> et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">6 PM</span>.</p><p>Par exemple sur le site :&nbsp;<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://huzounet.fr">https://huzounet.fr</a>, choisissez les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">équipements premium</span>.</p>', 0, 'Introduction', NULL, '#f59e0b', 220, 5760, true, '{}', 145, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.789', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.789');
