GuideStep">[GP80] DOFUS DU CAUCHEMAR</span>&nbsp;depuis l''<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étape 53</span>.</p></div></li></ul><ul data-type="taskList"><li data-checked="false" data-type="taskItem"><label><span></span></label><div><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Terminez </span>le guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="2024" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP84] LE SECRET DES DOFUS : PROLOGUE" label="[GP84] LE SECRET DES DOFUS : PROLOGUE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP84] LE SECRET DES DOFUS : PROLOGUE</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p><span style="color: rgb(250, 0, 0);">Félicitations !</span> Vous <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">obtenez </span>le&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="20286" class="tag-item" id="12650" type="item" name="Dofus Argenté Scintillant" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23027.png" dofusdbid="20286"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23027.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus Argenté Scintillant</span></span>&nbsp;et le&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="26066" class="tag-item" id="16395" type="item" name="Dofus du Cauchemar" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23034.png" dofusdbid="26066"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23034.png" alt="item"><span>Dofus du Cauchemar</span></span>.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(5, 160, 69);">Astuces :</span></p><p>1️⃣ Pour les<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"> 2 derniers guides</span> aux <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">étapes 53</span> et <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">14</span>, vous avez <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2 combats tactique</span> à faire sur la même map.</p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Finissez </span>les <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2 combats</span> avant de finir le&nbsp;guide <span data-type="guide-step" class="guide-step" guideid="2024" stepid="0" stepnumber="1" guidename="[GP84] LE SECRET DES DOFUS : PROLOGUE" label="[GP84] LE SECRET DES DOFUS : PROLOGUE" baseurl="https://ganymede-dofus.com"><img src="https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png" alt="GuideStep">[GP84] LE SECRET DES DOFUS : PROLOGUE</span>.</p><p>2️⃣ Grâce à&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="2420" class="tag-quest" id="1868" type="quest" name="Entretemps, une renaissance" imageurl="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_quest.png" dofusdbid="2420"><img src="https://ganymede-app.com/images/icon_quest.png" alt="quest"><span>Entretemps, une renaissance</span></span>,&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">utilisez</span> le&nbsp;<span data-type="custom-tag" data-id="26070" class="tag-item" id="16238" type="item" name="Coffret de la relique" imageurl="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/172001.png" dofusdbid="26070"><img src="https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/172001.png" alt="item"><span>Coffret de la relique</span></span>&nbsp;pour vous <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">téléporter </span>sur la <span style="color: rgb(98, 172, 255);">map de ces combats</span>.</p>', 81, '[GP81] QUATRE SUR SIX', NULL, '#f59e0b', 440, 5920, false, '{}', 150, '2026-05-02 12:06:59.882', '2026-05-02 12:06:59.882');
