umber": 29, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 81114, "map": "Douze", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 0, "pos_y": -18, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Shushu et Lulu\" questid=\"921\" questname=\"Shushu et Lulu\" status=\"end\"><p>Parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Hassen Cehef </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">et </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Montrer le ticket de Kerubim Crépin </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">pour finir la quête </span><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1201\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"921\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Shushu et Lulu\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1201\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Shushu et Lulu</span></span>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 160, 69);\">Astuces :</span></p><p></p><p>- La <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">diligence </span>permet de vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">téléporter </span>à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">3 endroits</span> isolés sur la carte.</p><p></p><p>- <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Cimetière des Héros</span> en [-21,-58].</p><p></p><p>- <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Routes Rocailleuses</span> en [-29,-15].</p><p></p><p>- <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Cimetière des Torturés</span> en [-10,36].</p></div><p></p><p>Vous débloquez <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">le succès : </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Faire le keke</span>.</p><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-1,-21]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">1 map à gauche</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><l