Number": 55, "hasCheckboxes": false}, {"id": 170344, "map": "Douze", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": -25, "pos_y": 33, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<p>En passant alignement 20, on débloque la<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> première quête d''ordre</span>.</p><p></p><p>Vous pouvez choisir de suivre un seul ordre uniquement, vous trouverez la liste ci-dessous :</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Ordre du <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Cœur Saignant</span> :<span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"0\" stepid=\"173353\" stepnumber=\"57\" label=\"\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">Etape 57</span> à <span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"0\" stepid=\"173357\" stepnumber=\"61\" label=\"\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">Etape 61</span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Ordre de l''<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Œil Putride</span> :<span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"0\" stepid=\"173358\" stepnumber=\"62\" label=\"\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">Etape 62</span> à <span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"0\" stepid=\"173782\" stepnumber=\"66\" label=\"\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">Etape 66</span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Ordre de l''<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Esprit Malsain</spa