akna 1 map à droite 3 maps en bas 1 map à gauche", "stepNumber": 150, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 192863, "map": "Douze", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 3, "pos_y": -2, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Apprentissage : Espion Sombre\" questid=\"53\" questname=\"Apprentissage : Espion Sombre\" status=\"in_progress\"><p>Cliquez sur la <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">dalle jaune</span> ci-dessous :</p><p></p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2C3Iex5.png\" class=\"img-large\"></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-22,33]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaap </span>de<span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\"> Brâkmar</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaapi</span> vers l''<span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Atelier des alchimistes</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">2 maps en haut</span></p></div></li></ul><p></p>", "guideRefs": [], "plainText": "Cliquez sur la dalle jaune ci-dessous : Ensuite allez en [-22,33] Zaap de Brâkmar Zaapi vers l'' Atelier des alchimistes 2 maps en haut", "stepNumber": 151, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 192864, "map": "Douze", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": -22, "pos_y": 33, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Apprentissage : Espion Sombre\" questid=\"53\" questname=\"Apprentissage : Espion Sombre\" status=\"end\"><p>Entrez dans la <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Tour des Ordres</span>.</p><p></p><p>Prenez le <span style=\"color: 