ien de Sabine . Ressortez de la maison. Parlez au Geôlier de Sabine . Ensuite allez en [-16,1] Zaap du Village des Eleveurs", "stepNumber": 192, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 291746, "map": "Douze", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": -16, "pos_y": 1, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Le cristal de Kain Dharyn\" questid=\"133\" questname=\"Le cristal de Kain Dharyn\" status=\"in_progress\"><p>Parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Klako</span> pour <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Envoyer de nouvelles menaces au Captain Starky</span>.</p></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-28,35]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaap </span>de <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Brâkmar</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaapi </span>vers l''<span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Hôtel de vente des équipements</span></p></div></li></ul><p></p>", "guideRefs": [], "plainText": "Parlez à Klako pour Envoyer de nouvelles menaces au Captain Starky . Ensuite allez en [-28,35] Zaap de Brâkmar Zaapi vers l'' Hôtel de vente des équipements", "stepNumber": 193, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 291747, "map": "Douze", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": -28, "pos_y": 35, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Le cristal de Kain Dharyn\" questid=\"133\" questname=\"Le cristal de Kain Dharyn\" status=\"in_progress\"><p>Entrez dans la <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">maison</span>.</p><p></p><p>Parlez au<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> Captain Starky</span>.</p></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(9