st <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">conseillé </span>de <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">faire </span>le <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">combat </span>à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">plusieurs</span>.</p><p></p><p>- Le <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"4376\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"2640\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Psybwork\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/266.png\" dofusdbid=\"4376\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/266.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Psybwork</span></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">soigne </span>ses <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">alliés</span>, vole <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">2 PO</span> et retire <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">2 PA</span>.</p><p></p><p>- Le <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"4377\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"2641\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Cyclwork\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/266.png\" dofusdbid=\"4377\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/266.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Cyclwork</span></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">minimise les effet aléatoires</span> à 2 PO et <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">érode</span>.</p><p></p><p>- Le <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"4375\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"2639\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Scibwork\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/266.png\" dofusdbid=\"4375\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/266.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Scibwork</span></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">intercepte les dommages</span> pour ses alliés, se <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">met un bouclier</span> et <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">retire 2 PM</span>.</p><p></p><p>Une fois fini, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">reparlez </span>lui.</p></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [2,-1]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li d