tag\" data-id=\"233\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"129\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Troollaraj\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/129.png\" dofusdbid=\"233\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/129.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Troollaraj</span></span> de <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">niveau 110</span> dans la zone <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Bois de Litneg</span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Une <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">lente </span>mais <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">facile </span>qui consiste à <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-3,12] dans la fosse pour <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">drop </span>à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">50%</span> sur le <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"791\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"429\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Trooll Apprivoisé\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/129.png\" dofusdbid=\"791\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/129.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Trooll Apprivoisé</span></span>.</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 160, 69);\">Astuces :</span></p><p></p><p>- Le <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"791\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"429\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Trooll Apprivoisé\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/129.png\" dofusdbid=\"791\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/129.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Trooll Apprivoisé</span></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">réapparait </span>toutes les <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">2 à 7 minutes</span>.</p><p></p><p>- Vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">pouvez </span>aussi <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">le trouver </span>dans le <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"13\" class=\"tag-dungeon\" id=\"10\" type=\"dungeon\" name=\"Donjon des Bworks\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" dofusdbid=\"13\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" alt=\"dungeon\"><span>Donjon des Bworks</span></span> en tombant dans le trou dans la <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Salle du cachot</span>.</p><p></p><p>- Pour <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">drop </span>les <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"8515\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"3102\" type=\"item\" name=\"Os de Trooll\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/47640.png\" dofusdbid=\"8515\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/47640.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Os de Trooll</span></span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">vérifiez </span>que vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">avez </span>le <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"8513\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"3100\" type=\"item\" name=\"Scalpel de Bworknroll\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/5060.png\" dofusdbid=\"8513\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/5060.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Scalpel de Bworknroll</span></span> sinon <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-5,10] pour le prendre auprès de <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Bworknroll</span>.</p><p></p><p>Une fois les 5 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"8515\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"3102\" type=\"item\" name=\"Os de Trooll\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/47640.png\" dofusdbid=\"8515\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/47640.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Os de Trooll</span></span> obtenus, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">vérifiez </span>que vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">avez </span>5 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"2264\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"1183\" type=\"item\" name=\"Canine de Gobelin\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/47878.png\" dofusdbid=\"2264\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/47878.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Canine de Gobelin</span></spa