color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">quête d''alignement 11 (étape 21) côté Brâkmar</span> <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"385\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"221\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Pauvre larve\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"385\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Pauvre larve</span></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">qui vous demande de réaliser le</span> <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"32\" class=\"tag-dungeon\" id=\"24\" type=\"dungeon\" name=\"Nid du Kwakwa\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" dofusdbid=\"32\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" alt=\"dungeon\"><span>Nid du Kwakwa</span></span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>La quête <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"904\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"630\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Un Kanniboul versé\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"904\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Un Kanniboul versé</span></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">du </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">tour du monde d''Emma Tompouce</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> qui vous demande d''accomplir le </span><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"27\" class=\"tag-dungeon\" id=\"20\" type=\"dungeon\" name=\"Village Kanniboul\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" dofusdbid=\"27\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" alt=\"dungeon\"><span>Village Kanniboul</span></span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>L''étape de la quête <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1668\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1370\" type=\