mede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"221\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Le Pwince Monseigneuw</span></span>.</p><p></p><p>Un <span style=\"color: rgb(250, 0, 0);\">combat </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">seul</span><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 0, 0);\"> </span>se lance en compagnie<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> </span>du <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1039\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"567\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Prince d''Wa\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/101.png\" dofusdbid=\"1039\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/101.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Prince d''Wa</span></span>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Une fois fini, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">reparlez </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">lui et dites </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Je suis à l</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">a recherche d''un prétendant...</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">, puis </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Mon seigneur, où sont vos gens, vous ne pouvez demander la main de la princesse ainsi</span>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Un nouveau </span><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 0, 0);\">combat </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">seul</span><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 0, 0);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">se lance </span>en compagnie<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> </span>du <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1039\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"567\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Prince d''Wa\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/101.png\" dofusdbid=\"1039\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/101.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Prince d''Wa</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Le Pwince Monseigneuw\"