</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Vérifiez </span>que vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">avez </span>les <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">ressources </span>suivantes :</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>10 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"416\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"181\" type=\"item\" name=\"Plume du Kwak de Vent\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/53113.png\" dofusdbid=\"416\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/53113.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Plume du Kwak de Vent</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>8 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"13730\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"7095\" type=\"item\" name=\"Graine de la Discorde\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/58472.png\" dofusdbid=\"13730\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/58472.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Graine de la Discorde</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>6 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1456\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"652\" type=\"item\" name=\"Ailes de Scarafeuille Blanc\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/104213.png\" dofusdbid=\"1456\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/104213.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Ailes de Scarafeuille Blanc</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>4 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1985\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"990\" type=\"item\" name=\"Résine\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15382.png\" dofusdbid=\"1985\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15382.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Ré