Sang d''encre . Félicitations ! Vous obtenez le Domakuro .", "stepNumber": 119, "hasCheckboxes": false}]', '2026-04-30 16:08:13.571', '2026-04-30 16:12:16.735');
INSERT INTO public."SubGuideData" VALUES ('cmolohb7a00c998og4btsjjwk', 'GP36', 602, '[GP36] Otomaï 3', 13, '[{"id": 135134, "map": null, "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 0, "pos_y": 0, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Niveau minimum pour commencer : 40+</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Niveau conseillé pour terminer : 150+</span></p><p></p><p>Ce guide vise à vous faire obtenir le succès <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Service de dépannage.</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Le succès comprend </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">6 quêtes</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">, de niveaux variés :</span></p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"236\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"119\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Paulette Pain-bèche la boulangère\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"236\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Paulette Pain-bèche la boulangère</span></span> (40)</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"235\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"118\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Polka Merer a besoin de vous\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"235\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Polka Merer a besoin de vous</span></span> (40)</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"234\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"117\" type=\"quest\" name=\"La Potion Bulbique\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"234\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>La Potion Bulbique</span></span> (40)</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"237\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"120\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Le fils caché\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"237\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Le fils caché</span></span> (90)</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"238\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"121\" type=\"quest\" name=\"La femme perdue\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"238\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>La femme perdue</span></span> (120)</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"241\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"124\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Les Chasses de Crocodaille Dandi\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"241\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Les Chasses de Crocodaille Dandi</span></span> (150 et vous récompense de 5x <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"8808\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"3328\" type=\"item\" name=\"Étoffe du Roissingue\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/55019.png\" dofusdbid=\"8808\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/55019.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Étoffe du Roissingue</span></span>, toujours bon à prendre !)</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(216, 27, 67);\"><strong>Prérequis :</strong></span></p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><