://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1380.png\" dofusdbid=\"4323\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1380.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Nincha</span></span>&nbsp;et 1&nbsp;<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"4322\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"2282\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Shinobite\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1379.png\" dofusdbid=\"4322\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1379.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Shinobite</span></span>.</p><p></p><p>- Le&nbsp;<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"4322\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"2282\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Shinobite\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1379.png\" dofusdbid=\"4322\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1379.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Shinobite</span></span>&nbsp;met un <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">poison </span>sur les <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">PA</span> et <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">PM utilisé</span> à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">10 PO</span>.</p><p></p><p>- Les&nbsp;<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"4323\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"2283\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Nincha\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1380.png\" dofusdbid=\"4323\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1380.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Nincha</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">tape </span>jusqu''à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">8 PO</span>, s''il ne <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">tape pas </span>alors il <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">retire </span>soit <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">4 PO</span> soit <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">200 puissance</span>.</p><p></p><p>Une fois le <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">combat remporté</span>, reparlez au <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Shinobite</span>.</p><p></p><p>Reparlez ensuite au <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Professeur Groschinder</spa