stres de quête</span> aux positions ci-dessous :</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Un <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"6421\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"4083\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Tanuki mort de fatigue\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2102.png\" dofusdbid=\"6421\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2102.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Tanuki mort de fatigue</span></span> en [24,-25].</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Un <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"6421\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"4083\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Tanuki mort de fatigue\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2102.png\" dofusdbid=\"6421\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2102.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Tanuki mort de fatigue</span></span> en [26,-26].</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Un <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"6421\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"4083\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Tanuki mort de fatigue\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2102.png\" dofusdbid=\"6421\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2102.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Tanuki mort de fatigue</span></span> en [25,-22] dans la <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">première salle</span> de la <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">mine</span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Un <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"6421\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"4083\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Tanuki mort de fatigue\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2102.png\" dofusdbid=\"6421\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2102.png\" alt=