 data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>30 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"7379\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"2321\" type=\"item\" name=\"Fleur d''Onabu-Geisha\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164766.png\" dofusdbid=\"7379\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164766.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Fleur d''Onabu-Geisha</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>30 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"7407\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"2336\" type=\"item\" name=\"Croissant de Tsukinochi\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164764.png\" dofusdbid=\"7407\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164764.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Croissant de Tsukinochi</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>30 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"7404\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"2333\" type=\"item\" name=\"Os de Jiangshi-Nobi\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164767.png\" dofusdbid=\"7404\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164767.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Os de Jiangshi-Nobi</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Commencez </span>par <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">faire</span> 30 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"23694\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"15295\" type=\"item\" name=\"Concassé de brume\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/64406.png\" dofusdbid=\"23694\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/64406.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Concassé de brume</span></span> auprès d''un <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Concasseur </span>d''un <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Atelier des forgemages</span>. (<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">fusionner des ressources</span>)<