 src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Passe le fungus autour de toi</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1866\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1562\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Appui sur le champignon\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1866\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Appui sur le champignon</span></span> (<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"22\" class=\"tag-dungeon\" id=\"17\" type=\"dungeon\" name=\"Temple du Grand Ougah\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" dofusdbid=\"22\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" alt=\"dungeon\"><span>Temple du Grand Ougah</span></span>)</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1876\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1572\" type=\"quest\" name=\"La prolifération a crû\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1876\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>La prolifération a crû</span></span></p></div></li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(216, 27, 67);\"><strong>Prérequis :</strong></span></p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Avoir accompli <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1860\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1556\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Trou de mémoire\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1860\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Trou de mémoire</span></span> du guide <span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"306\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP23] Sidimote 1 : Les landes mortes\" label=\"Sidimote 1 : Les landes mortes\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">Sidimote 1 : Les landes mortes</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p></p>", "guideRefs": [{"label": "Sidimote 1 : Les landes mortes", "guideId": 306, "guideName": "[GP23] Sidimote 1 : Les landes mortes", "stepNumber": 1}], "plainText": "Niveau minimum conseillé : 180+ Ce guide vise à vous faire réaliser le succès Les spores, c''est la santé qui comprend 5 quêtes et 1 donjon : Champallucination Le baptême du feu Passe le fungus autour de toi Appui sur le champignon ( Temple du Grand Ougah ) La prolifération a crû Prérequis : Avoir accompli Trou de mémoire du guide Sidimote 1 : Les landes mortes .", "stepNumber": 1, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 135211, "map": null, "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 0, "pos_y": 0, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<p>Voici la liste des ressources à prévoir pour ce guide :</p><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Champallucination\" questid=\"1559\" questname=\"Champallucination\" status=\"setup\"><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1863\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1559\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Champallucination\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1863\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Champallucination</span></span> :</p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>1x <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"15990\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"9101\" type=\"item\" name=\"Baguette Rikiki\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/3086.png\" dofusdbid=\"15990\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/3086.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Baguette Rikiki</span></span></p></di