à Topo . Ensuite allez en [22,28] 2 maps en haut Ascenseur 1 map à gauche", "stepNumber": 82, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 325663, "map": "Douze", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 22, "pos_y": 28, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Topo le petit robot\" questid=\"1436\" questname=\"Topo le petit robot\" status=\"end\"><p>Entrez dans la <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">maison</span>.</p><p></p><p>Parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Prosper Meraimée</span> pour finir la quête <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1734\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1436\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Topo le petit robot\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1734\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Topo le petit robot</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Piège de crystal\" questid=\"1437\" questname=\"Piège de crystal\" status=\"start\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Continuez </span>de lui <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">parler </span>pour lancer la quête <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1735\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1437\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Piège de crystal\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1735\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Piège de crystal</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [23,27]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Ressortez</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">1 map en haut</span></p></di