 <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 160, 69);\">façonneur 200</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 160, 69);\">Astuce :</span></p><p></p><p>- La <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17968\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"10619\" type=\"item\" name=\"Statuette de Snedon\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/181006.png\" dofusdbid=\"17968\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/181006.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Statuette de Snedon</span></span> fait parti des objets d''exploration nécessaire tout au long de l''abyssale.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Recette :</span></p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>50 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17985\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"10636\" type=\"item\" name=\"Patte de Li-Fo\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/103727.png\" dofusdbid=\"17985\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/103727.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Patte de Li-Fo</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>20 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17995\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"10646\" type=\"item\" name=\"Écume de mer\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/39399.png\" dofusdbid=\"17995\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/39399.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Écume de mer</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>20 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17992\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"10643\" type=\"item\" name=\"Salikrone\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36653.png\" dofusdbid=\"17992\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36653.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Salikrone</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>10 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17988\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"10639\" type=\"item\" name=\"Pierre Angulaire\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/51499.png\" dofusdbid=\"17988\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/51499.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Pierre Angulaire</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>10 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17993\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"10644\" type=\"item\" name=\"Quisnoa\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34560.png\" dofusdbid=\"17993\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34560.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Quisnoa</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>1 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17870\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"10522\" type=\"item\" name=\"Socle en coquillage\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164100.png\" dofusdbid=\"17870\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164100.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Socle en coquillage</span></span> : vous l''avez déjà.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>2<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17864\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"10516\" type=\"item\" name=\"Ambre de muldo\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164094.png\" dofusdbid=\"17864\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164094.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Ambre de muldo</span></span> : <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Pinke Tada</span> à la <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">surface </span>en [23,24].</p></div></li></ul></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [21,22]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"tas