se\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>En [25,28] : parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Dan Wich</span> pour finir la quête <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1754\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1456\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Aux grands mots les grands remèdes\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1754\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Aux grands mots les grands remèdes</span></span>.</p></div></li></ul></div><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Nos chairs voisines\" questid=\"1457\" questname=\"Nos chairs voisines\" status=\"end\"><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>En [22,28] : parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Marine Ancrenage</span> pour finir la quête <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1755\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1457\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Nos chairs voisines\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1755\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Nos chairs voisines</span></span>.</p></div></li></ul></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en </span>[21,24] à la <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Surface</span>.</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaap </span>de <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Sufokia</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaapi </span>vers le <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Quai de la voie du temple</span></p></div></li><