com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" dofusdbid=\"87\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_dungeon.png\" alt=\"dungeon\"><span>Œil de Vortex</span></span>)</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Moments d''égarement </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">comprend </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">6 quêtes</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> :</span></p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1590\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1295\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Déchirures temporelles\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1590\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Déchirures temporelles</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1597\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1302\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Futur antérieur\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1597\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Futur antérieur</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1598\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1303\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Guerre temporelle\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1598\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Guerre temporelle</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1599\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1304\" type=\"quest\" name=\"L''étendue Gödelique\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1599\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>L''étendue Gödelique</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1600\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1305\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Les visiteurs du futur\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1600\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Les visiteurs du futur</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1602\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1307\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Demain ne meurt jamais\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1602\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Demain ne meurt jamais</span></span></p></div></li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(216, 27, 67);\"><strong>Prérequis :</strong></span></p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Avoir accompli </span><span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"435\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP44] Xélorium 2\" label=\"[GP44] Xélorium 2\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP44] Xélorium 2</span>.</p></div></li></ul><p></p>", "guideRefs": [{"label": "[GP44] Xélorium 2", "guideId": 435, "guideName": "[GP44] Xélorium 2", "stepNumber": 1}], "plainText": "Niveau minimum conseillé : 200 Ce guide vise à vous faire réaliser les succès Les puits du fou ainsi que Moments d''égarement qui sont nécessaires à l''acquisition du Dofus Nébuleux . Les puits du fou consiste en 5 quêtes et un donjon : Juste une illusion Maboul de cristal L''armée des 12 dingues La vérité est au fond du puits ( Œil de Vortex ) Les sables du temps ( Œil de Vortex ) Moments d''égarement comprend 6 quêtes : Déchirures temporelles Futur antérieur Guerre temporelle L''étendue Gödelique Les visiteurs du futur Demain ne meurt jamais Prérequis : Avoir accompli [GP44] Xélorium 2 .", "stepNumber": 1, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 103186, "map": null, "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 0, "pos_y": 0, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<p>Pour réaliser ce guide, prévoyez :</p><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"L''étendue Gödelique\" questid=\"1304\" questname=\"L''étendue Gödelique\" status=\"setup\"><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1599\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1304\" type=\"quest\" name=\"L''étendue Gödelique\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1599\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>L''étendue Gödelique</span></span> :</p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>1 à 3x <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"15717\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"8839\" type=\"item\" name=\"Corne de Méjaire\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15897.png\" dofusdbid=\"15717\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15897.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Corne de Méjaire</span></span> (possibilité de drop sur place)</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>1 à 3x <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"15716\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"8838\" type=\"item\" name=\"Serre d''Ikargn\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/15896.png\" dofusdbid=\"15716