urs</span>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 160, 69);\">Astuces :</span></p><p></p><p>- Il est <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">conseillé </span>de faire le <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">combat </span>à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">plusieurs</span>.</p><p></p><p>- Vous affrontez <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">3 vagues</span> de <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">8 monstres</span> de la zone <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Epaves Silencieuses</span>.</p><p></p><p>- A la <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">3ème vague</span>, selon le <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">nombre </span>de <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">personnages </span>en vie, <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">X</span> <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"5150\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"3048\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Renfort Steamer\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1700.png\" dofusdbid=\"5150\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1700.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Renfort Steamer</span></span> viendront <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">vous aider</span>.</p><p></p><p>- Pensez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">utiliser </span>le sort : <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"19395\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"11796\" type=\"item\" name=\"Nécronyx\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/29011.png\" dofusdbid=\"19395\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/29011.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Nécronyx</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 160, 69);\"> </span>avant de les tuer.</p><p></p><p>- <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Equipez </span>les <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"19415\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"11815\" type=\"item\" name=\"Gants de Zrid\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/20005.png\" dofusdbid=\"19415\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/20005.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Gants de Zrid</span></span> pour <span style=\