span>plus bas, récoltez <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">6 lots</span> de <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">5 ressources récoltables</span> dans la dimension <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Wukin et Wukang</span>.</p><p></p><p>Si vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">n''avez pas</span> les <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">métiers</span>, vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">achèterez </span>les <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">6 lots</span> à l''étape <span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"0\" stepid=\"364612\" stepnumber=\"44\" label=\"\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">Etape 44</span>.</p><p></p><p>Liste des <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">ressources récoltables</span> :</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>5 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"23825\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"15414\" type=\"item\" name=\"Pichon d''encre\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/41420.png\" dofusdbid=\"23825\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/41420.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Pichon d''encre</span></span> : métier <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">pêcheur 200</span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>5 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"23824\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"15413\" type=\"item\" name=\"Tulipe en papier\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164832.png\" dofusdbid=\"23824\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164832.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Tulipe en papier</span></span> : métier <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">alchimiste 200</span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></l