heur''Gueule\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1999.png\" dofusdbid=\"6029\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/1999.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Nheur''Gueule</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>7 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"6030\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"3762\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Tentaclaque\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2000.png\" dofusdbid=\"6030\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2000.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Tentaclaque</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>8 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"6031\" class=\"tag-monster\" id=\"3763\" type=\"monster\" name=\"Gangredogue\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2001.png\" dofusdbid=\"6031\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/monsters/2001.png\" alt=\"monster\"><span>Gangredogue</span></span></p></div></li></ul></div><p></p><p>Une fois fini, <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">revenez en</span> [0,3]</p>", "guideRefs": [], "plainText": "Il suffit de passer sur la map pour mettre à jour la quête Mort et renouveau . Tuez les monstres suivants : 5 Dolid 6 Nheur''Gueule 7 Tentaclaque 8 Gangredogue Une fois fini, revenez en [0,3]", "stepNumber": 31, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 394440, "map": "Corruption", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 0, "pos_y": 3, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Mort et renouveau\" questid=\"1794\" questname=\"Mort et renouveau\" status=\"in_progress\"><p>Parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Kernuros</span>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Vérifiez </span>que vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">avez </span>les 80 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"311\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"93