\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164659.png\" dofusdbid=\"7222\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/164659.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Artefact Pandawushu Eau</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>4 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1538\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"721\" type=\"item\" name=\"Métaria Mage jaune\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/66249.png\" dofusdbid=\"1538\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/66249.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Métaria Mage jaune</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>4 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1535\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"718\" type=\"item\" name=\"Métaria Mage rouge\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/66243.png\" dofusdbid=\"1535\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/66243.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Métaria Mage rouge</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>4 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1537\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"720\" type=\"item\" name=\"Métaria Mage verte\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/66252.png\" dofusdbid=\"1537\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/66252.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Métaria Mage verte</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>4 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1536\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"719\" type=\"item\" name=\"Métaria Mage bleue\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/66246.png\" dofusdbid=\"1536\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/66246.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Métaria Mage bleue</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><sp