ass=\"tag-item\" id=\"16127\" type=\"item\" name=\"Emprise exaltante\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/165003.png\" dofusdbid=\"25819\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/165003.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Emprise exaltante</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>5 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"25820\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"16128\" type=\"item\" name=\"Emprise destructrice\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/165004.png\" dofusdbid=\"25820\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/165004.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Emprise destructrice</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>1 <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"25818\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"16126\" type=\"item\" name=\"Page du grimoire de Rewona\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/165002.png\" dofusdbid=\"25818\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/165002.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Page du grimoire de Rewona</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div></li></ul></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-24,39]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaap </span>de <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Brâkmar</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaapi </span>vers l''<span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Hôtel de vente des créatures</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">1 map à droite</span></p></di