><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span></p></div><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Balance la sauce\" questid=\"1249\" questname=\"Balance la sauce\" status=\"start\"><p>Entrez dans l''<span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Avant-poste des Voyageurs</span>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Parlez au </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Sergent Raskzac</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> pour lancer la quête </span><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1540\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1249\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Balance la sauce\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1540\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Balance la sauce</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Courir après des ombres\" questid=\"1268\" questname=\"Courir après des ombres\" status=\"start\"><p>Parlez ensuite à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Volron Dumhaz </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">pour lancer la quête </span><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1559\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1268\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Courir après des ombres\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"1559\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Courir après des ombres</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Les sentiers de la perdition\" questid=\"1257\" questname=\"Les sentiers de la perdition\" status=\"start\"><p>Enfin parlez à<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> Kathy Brennan </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">pour lancer la quête </span><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"1548\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1257\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Les sentiers de la perdition\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/ima