cked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"7754\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"2502\" type=\"item\" name=\"Dofus Ocre\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png\" dofusdbid=\"7754\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23012.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Dofus Ocre</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"7115\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"2122\" type=\"item\" name=\"Dofus Ivoire\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23011.png\" dofusdbid=\"7115\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23011.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Dofus Ivoire</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"7114\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"2121\" type=\"item\" name=\"Dofus Ébène\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23007.png\" dofusdbid=\"7114\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23007.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Dofus Ébène</span></span></p></div></li></ul></div><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-3,-4]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Ressortez</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaap </span>du <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Village d''Amakna</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">4 maps en haut</span></p></div></li><li data-chec