te", "stepNumber": 51, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 390012, "map": "Guerre", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 4, "pos_y": -3, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Voyage au bout de l''Externam\" questid=\"1785\" questname=\"Voyage au bout de l''Externam\" status=\"in_progress\"><p>Parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Ralag Vivargent</span> pour <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Remercier Ralag et aller discuter avec le Chevalier de l’Automne</span>.</p><p></p><p>Parlez au <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Chevalier de l’Automne</span>.</p></div><p></p><p>Ensuite<span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\"> allez en</span> [4,-3]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">1 map à gauche</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">1 map en bas</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Escaliers</span></p></div></li></ul><p></p>", "guideRefs": [], "plainText": "Parlez à Ralag Vivargent pour Remercier Ralag et aller discuter avec le Chevalier de l’Automne . Parlez au Chevalier de l’Automne . Ensuite allez en [4,-3] 1 map à gauche 1 map en bas Escaliers", "stepNumber": 52, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 390013, "map": "Guerre", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 4, "pos_y": -3, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Voyage au bout de l''Externam\" questid=\"1785\" questname=\"Voyage au bout de l''Externam\" status=\"end\"><p>Parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Guerre</span>.</p><p></p><p>Parlez au <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Chevalier de l’Automne</span> pour finir la quête <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"2116\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1785\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Voyage au bout de l''Externam\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"2116\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Voyage au bout de l''Externam</span></span>.</p><p></p><p>Vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">obtenez </span>la <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"22172\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"14319\" type=\"item\" name=\"Volonté de Guerre\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/126099.png\" dofusdbid=\"22172\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/126099.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Volonté de Guerre</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><p>Si vous n''avez <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">pas fait</span> les <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">autres cavaliers</span> vous trouverez les <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">guides </span>ci-dessous :</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"2010\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP73] MISERE\" label=\"[GP73] MISERE\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP73] MISERE</span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"2011\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP74] CORRUPTION\" label=\"[GP74] CORRUPTION\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP74] CORRUPTION</span>&nbsp;</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"2009\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP76] SERVITUDE\" label=\"[GP76] SERVITUDE\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP76] SERVITUDE</span>&nbsp;</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p>Sinon vous si vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">avez terminé</span>, vous pouvez <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">reprendre </span>le <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">guide </span><span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"1914\" stepid=\"388940\" stepnumber=\"22\" guidename=\"[GP78] L''AVENIR DU FUTUR\" label=\"\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP78] L''AVENIR DU FUTUR : Etape 22</span>.</p>", "guideRefs": [{"label": "[GP73] MISERE", "guideId": 2010, "guideName": "[GP73] MISERE", "stepNumber": 1}, {"label": "[GP74] CORRUPTION", "guideId": 2011, "guideName": "[GP74] CORRUPTION", "stepNumber": 1}, {"label": "[GP76] SERVITUDE", "guideId": 2009, "guideName": "[GP76] SERVITUDE", "stepNumber": 1}, {"label": "", "guideId": 1914, "guideName": "[GP78] L''AVENIR DU FUTUR", "stepNumber": 22}], "plainText": "Parlez à Guerre . Parlez au Chevalier de l’Automne pour finir la quête Voyage au bout de l''Externam . Vous obtenez la Volonté de Guerre . Si vous n''avez pas fait les autres cavaliers vous trouverez les guides ci-dessous : [GP73] MISERE [GP74] CORRUPTION [GP76] SERVITUDE Sinon vous si vous avez terminé , vous pouvez reprendre le guide [GP78] L''AVENIR DU FUTUR : Etape 22 .", "stepNumber": 53, "hasCheckboxes": true}]', '2026-04-30 16:08:26.695', '2026-04-30 16:12:33.513');
