/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"2164\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Dites-le avec des fleurs</span></span> dans le guide <span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"428\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP35] Pandala 1 : Villages + 100%\" label=\"[GP35] Pandala 1 :Villages + 100%\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP35] Pandala 1 :Villages + 100%</span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"2011\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP74] CORRUPTION\" label=\"[GP74] CORRUPTION\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP74] CORRUPTION</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"2023\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP80] DOFUS DU CAUCHEMAR\" label=\"[GP80] DOFUS DU CAUCHEMAR\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP80] DOFUS DU CAUCHEMAR</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"113\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3\" label=\"[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP50] DDG-FRIGOST 3</span></p></div></li></ul><p></p>", "guideRefs": [{"label": "[GP7] Ocre d''Ambre", "guideId": 104, "guideName": "[GP7] Ocre d''Ambre", "ste