://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Frappez, ami, et entrez</span></span>.</p><p></p><p>- Vous la <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">trouverez </span>de l''<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">étape 4</span> à l''<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">étape 6</span> du guide <span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"2047\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP60] ROYAUME DES MARTEGEL\" label=\"[GP60] ROYAUME DES MARTEGEL\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP60] ROYAUME DES MARTEGEL</span>.</p><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-65,-72]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">1 map à droite</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Portail </span>pour <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Quitter la dimension</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaap </span>du <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Village enseveli</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">1 map à gauche</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">4 maps en bas</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172,