=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"2163\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1814\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Infâme pourriture\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"2163\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Infâme pourriture</span></span></p><p></p></div></li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Des larmes de pierre </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">qui comprend </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">4 quêtes</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> :</span></p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"2171\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1822\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Cent kamas pour un Kwapa\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"2171\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Cent kamas pour un Kwapa</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"2170\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1821\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Les habitudes ont l''eau-de-vie dure\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"2170\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Les habitudes ont l''eau-de-vie dure</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"2167\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1818\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Les métamorphoses d''un Tanuki\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"2167\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Les métamorphoses d''un Tanuki</span></span></