is les monstres vaincus , retournez en [-83,-15] .", "stepNumber": 39, "hasCheckboxes": true}, {"id": 213067, "map": "Crocuzko", "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": -83, "pos_y": -15, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Le tort tue\" questid=\"1762\" questname=\"Le tort tue\" status=\"end\"><p>Parlez au <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Gobelin trouillard</span> pour finir la quête <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"2088\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1762\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Le tort tue\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"2088\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Le tort tue</span></span>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(5, 160, 69);\">Astuce :</span></p><p></p><p>- Il ne doit <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">pas avoir</span> de <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">groupe </span>de <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">monstre </span>sur la map pour <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">rendre </span>la <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">quête</span>.</p></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 0, 0);\">Félicitations ! </span>Vous <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">obtenez </span>le succès : <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Larmes de crocodaille</span>.</p>", "guideRefs": [], "plainText": "Parlez au Gobelin trouillard pour finir la quête Le tort tue . Astuce : - Il ne doit pas avoir de groupe de monstre sur la map pour rendre la quête . Félicitations ! Vous obtenez le succès : Larmes de crocodaille .", "stepNumber": 40, "hasCheckboxes": false}]', '2026-04-30 16:08:23.509', '2026-04-30 16:12:31.07');
INSERT INTO public."SubGuideData" VALUES ('cmolohise00d398og5aevossa', 'GP67', 704, '[GP67] Dofus Vulbis', 47, '[{"id": 157642, "map": null, "name": null, "items": [], "pos_x": 0, "pos_y": 0, "dungeons": [], "web_text": "<p>Ce guide permet l''<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">obtention</span> du <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"21186\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"13402\" type=\"item\" name=\"Dofus Vulbis\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png\" dofusdbid=\"21186\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/23004.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Dofus Vulbis</span></span>.</p><p></p><p>Il faut être <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">niveau 180</span> pour le <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">commencer </span>mais <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">niveau 200</span> pour le <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">finir</span>.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 0, 0);\">Prérequis :</span></p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>Avoir fini <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"2064\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"1738\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Ce sera mieux avant\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"2064\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Ce sera mieux avant</span></span> du guide <span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"1714\" stepid=\"0\" stepnumber=\"1\" guidename=\"[GP66] Eliocalypse Résonance\" label=\"[GP66] Eliocalypse Résonance\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">[GP66] Eliocalypse Résonance</span>. (uniquement drop <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"21189\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"13404\" type=\"item\" name=\"Parangon de puissance\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/50733.png\" dofusdbid=\"21189\"