.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Rentrer brocouille</span></span> ayant des <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">conditions horaires</span> et de<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> jours</span>, celles-ci sont <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">isolées </span>de l''<span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"0\" stepid=\"594476\" stepnumber=\"183\" label=\"\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">Etape 183</span> à l''<span data-type=\"guide-step\" class=\"guide-step\" guideid=\"0\" stepid=\"594482\" stepnumber=\"189\" label=\"\" baseurl=\"https://ganymede-app.com\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-app.com/images/texteditor/guides.png\" alt=\"GuideStep\">Etape 189</span>.</p><p></p><p>Les <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">autres quêtes</span> seront <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">optimisées entre elles</span> comme d''habitude.</p><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-80,-81]</p><p></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Zaap </span>de <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">La Bourgade</span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"11994\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"5703\" type=\"item\" name=\"Paire de skis rustiques jetables\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/24908.png\" dofusdbid=\"11994\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/24908.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Paire de skis rustiques jetables</span></span></p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">Transporteur frigostien</span> ve