36644.png\" dofusdbid=\"16385\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/36644.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Ginseng</span></span> et/ou <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">fabriquez </span>des <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"16414\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"9432\" type=\"item\" name=\"Potion Raide Izdaide\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12753.png\" dofusdbid=\"16414\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/12753.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Potion Raide Izdaide</span></span> si vous êtes <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">alchimiste</span>.</p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">🥩 Chasseur 170 à 180 🥩</p><p></p><p>Pour monter le métier <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">chasseur niveau 180</span>, prévoyez :</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><ul data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>159&nbsp;<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"17154\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"9990\" type=\"item\" name=\"Viande Maigre\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63391.png\" dofusdbid=\"17154\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/63391.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Viande Maigre</span></span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>318&nbsp;<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"425\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"190\" type=\"item\" name=\"Chanvre\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34121.png\" dofusdbid=\"425\"><img src=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/34121.png\" alt=\"item\"><span>Chanvre</span></span>.</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>159&nbsp;<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"519\" class=\"tag-item\" id=\"248\" type=\"item\" name=\"Poudre de Perlinpainpain\" imageurl=\"https://api.dofusdb.fr/img/items/48002.png\" dofusdbid=\"519\"><img src=\