>La voie du guerrier</span></span>.</p><p></p><p>Ensuite <span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [6,-18] et parlez à <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Metag Robill </span>pour finir&nbsp;<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"157\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"86\" type=\"quest\" name=\"La voie du guerrier\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"157\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>La voie du guerrier</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Le tracas du guerrier\" questid=\"620\" questname=\"Le tracas du guerrier\" status=\"start\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Continuez </span>de lui <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">parler </span>pour lancer <span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"893\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"620\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Le tracas du guerrier\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"893\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Le tracas du guerrier</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><div data-type=\"quest-block\" class=\"quest-block\" title=\"Le tracas du guerrier\" questid=\"620\" questname=\"Le tracas du guerrier\" status=\"end\"><p>Enfin&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(98, 172, 255);\">allez en</span> [-6,-37] et parlez au <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Maître des clefs</span> pour finir&nbsp;<span data-type=\"custom-tag\" data-id=\"893\" class=\"tag-quest\" id=\"620\" type=\"quest\" name=\"Le tracas du guerrier\" imageurl=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" dofusdbid=\"893\"><img src=\"https://ganymede-dofus.com/images/icon_quest.png\" alt=\"quest\"><span>Le tracas du guerrier</span></span>.</p></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 0, 0);\">Félicitations !</span> Vous terminez le succès : <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Le Tour du monde en 27 donjo